{"name":"Enchanting Ways","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/elements-air-earth-fire-water.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"alchemist-enchanting-ways","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Alchemy Companion","sourceList":"Enchanting Ways","sourcePage":81,"merpRealm":"Essence","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Alchemist","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"Alchemy Companion p.81 — Core-Rules Alchemist Base List; MERP/RMSS Alchemist adaptation"},"compendiumSourceKey":"alchemist-enchanting-ways","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-essence-alchemist","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Voies de l'Enchantement","system":{"name":"Voies de l'Enchantement","label":"Voies de l'Enchantement","notesLabel":"Voies de l'Enchantement — notes","notes":"<h2>Voies de l'Enchantement</h2><p>Enchante armes, armures et objets généraux et permet de conférer différents degrés d’intelligence aux objets. Les bonus d’une même série ne sont pas cumulatifs : une version supérieure remplace la précédente.</p><p>Les capacités spéciales particulières — armes tueuses, pouvoirs uniques, résistances spéciales, etc. — restent soumises à la décision du MJ et aux règles de création d’objets.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Enchanting Ways","system":{"name":"Enchanting Ways","label":"Enchanting Ways","notesLabel":"Enchanting Ways — notes","notes":"<h2>Enchanting Ways</h2><p>Enchants weapons, armor, and general objects and allows different degrees of intelligence to be granted to items. Bonuses from the same series are not cumulative: a higher version replaces the previous one.</p><p>Specific special abilities—slaying weapons, unique powers, special resistances, and so on—remain subject to the GM's decision and the item-creation rules.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts d’Essence","Alchimiste (Base)"],"en":["Essence Spell Lists","Alchemist (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-essence","spell-lists-essence-alchemist"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / Alchemy Companion","name":"Enchanting Ways","listType":"Base","realms":"Essence","profession":"Alchemist","notes":"<h2>Enchanting Ways</h2><p>Enchants weapons, armor, and general objects and allows different degrees of intelligence to be granted to items. Bonuses from the same series are not cumulative: a higher version replaces the previous one.</p><p>Specific special abilities—slaying weapons, unique powers, special resistances, and so on—remain subject to the GM's decision and the item-creation rules.</p>","label":"Enchanting Ways","notesLabel":"Enchanting Ways — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Enchanting Ways","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Research","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.Research.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.Research.description","level":1,"description":"Researches special enchanted abilities for item creation; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate research or item-creation rolls concerning enchantment.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Recherche","description":"Recherche des capacités enchantées spéciales destinées à la création d’objets ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets de recherche ou de création d’objets concernant l’enchantement."},"en":{"name":"Research","description":"Researches special enchanted abilities for item creation; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate research or item-creation rolls concerning enchantment."}}},{"spellList":"Enchanting Ways","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Empathy","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.Empathy.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.Empathy.description","level":3,"description":"Enchants an item with an empathic intelligence; the intelligence or spirit itself must come from another appropriate source.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Empathie","description":"Enchante un objet en lui conférant une intelligence empathique ; l’intelligence ou l’esprit lui-même doit provenir d’une autre source appropriée."},"en":{"name":"Empathy","description":"Enchants an item with an empathic intelligence; the intelligence or spirit itself must come from another appropriate source."}}},{"spellList":"Enchanting Ways","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Weapon I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.WeaponI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.WeaponI.description","level":4,"description":"Enchants a weapon with a +5 bonus.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Arme I","description":"Enchante une arme en lui conférant un bonus de +5."},"en":{"name":"Weapon I","description":"Enchants a weapon with a +5 bonus."}}},{"spellList":"Enchanting Ways","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Armor I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.ArmorI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.ArmorI.description","level":5,"description":"As Weapon I, but affects armor or shields.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Armure I","description":"Comme Arme I, mais affecte une armure ou un bouclier."},"en":{"name":"Armor I","description":"As Weapon I, but affects armor or shields."}}},{"spellList":"Enchanting Ways","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"General I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.GeneralI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.GeneralI.description","level":6,"description":"Enchants a general magic item with a +5 bonus; may also create +1 spell adders or x1.5 spell multipliers.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Général I","description":"Enchante un objet magique à usage général avec un bonus de +5 ; peut également créer des additionneurs de sorts +1 ou des multiplicateurs de PP ×1,5."},"en":{"name":"General I","description":"Enchants a general magic item with a +5 bonus; may also create +1 spell adders or x1.5 spell multipliers."}}},{"spellList":"Enchanting Ways","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Low Intelligence","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.LowIntelligence.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.LowIntelligence.description","level":7,"description":"As Empathy, but grants low intelligence.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Intelligence Faible","description":"Comme Empathie, mais confère une intelligence faible."},"en":{"name":"Low Intelligence","description":"As Empathy, but grants low intelligence."}}},{"spellList":"Enchanting Ways","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Weapon II","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.WeaponII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.WeaponII.description","level":8,"description":"As Weapon I, but grants a +10 bonus.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Arme II","description":"Comme Arme I, mais confère un bonus de +10."},"en":{"name":"Weapon II","description":"As Weapon I, but grants a +10 bonus."}}},{"spellList":"Enchanting Ways","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Armor II","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.ArmorII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EnchantingWays.spells.ArmorII.description","leve