{"name":"Essence Imbedding","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/elements-air-earth-fire-water.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"alchemist-essence-imbedding","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Alchemy Companion","sourceList":"Essence Imbedding","sourcePage":79,"merpRealm":"Essence","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Alchemist","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"Alchemy Companion p.79 — Core-Rules Alchemist Base List; MERP/RMSS Alchemist adaptation"},"compendiumSourceKey":"alchemist-essence-imbedding","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-essence-alchemist","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation d'Essence","system":{"name":"Imprégnation d'Essence","label":"Imprégnation d'Essence","notesLabel":"Imprégnation d'Essence — notes","notes":"<h2>Imprégnation d'Essence</h2><p>Liste de base classique de l’Alchimiste pour fixer des sorts d’Essence dans des objets. Les sorts de création ont généralement une durée de travail de 24 heures ; cette durée décrit le travail magique quotidien et non la durée de vie de l’objet terminé.</p><p>Les sorts de la version source au-delà du niveau 90 ne sont pas inclus dans cette première conversion, afin de rester dans l’échelle épique actuellement utilisée par RMU Treasure Law.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Essence Imbedding","system":{"name":"Essence Imbedding","label":"Essence Imbedding","notesLabel":"Essence Imbedding — notes","notes":"<h2>Essence Imbedding</h2><p>Classic Alchemist Base List for binding Essence spells into objects. Creation spells generally require 24 hours of work; this duration describes the daily magical work and not the lifetime of the finished object.</p><p>Source spells above level 90 are not included in this first conversion, in order to remain within the epic scale currently used by RMU Treasure Law.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts d’Essence","Alchimiste (Base)"],"en":["Essence Spell Lists","Alchemist (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-essence","spell-lists-essence-alchemist"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / Alchemy Companion","name":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","realms":"Essence","profession":"Alchemist","notes":"<h2>Essence Imbedding</h2><p>Classic Alchemist Base List for binding Essence spells into objects. Creation spells generally require 24 hours of work; this duration describes the daily magical work and not the lifetime of the finished object.</p><p>Source spells above level 90 are not included in this first conversion, in order to remain within the epic scale currently used by RMU Treasure Law.</p>","label":"Essence Imbedding","notesLabel":"Essence Imbedding — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Research","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.Research.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.Research.description","level":1,"description":"Researches special imbedding spells for item creation; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Spell Research and/or Item Creation rolls concerning Essence imbedding.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Recherche","description":"Recherche des sorts d’imprégnation spéciaux destinés à la création d’objets ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets appropriés de Recherche de Sorts et/ou de Création d’Objets concernant l’imprégnation de l’Essence."},"en":{"name":"Research","description":"Researches special imbedding spells for item creation; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Spell Research and/or Item Creation rolls concerning Essence imbedding."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedI.description","level":3,"description":"Imbeds one 1st-level Essence spell in an item or potion.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation I","description":"Imprègne dans un objet ou une potion un sort d’Essence de niveau 1."},"en":{"name":"Imbed I","description":"Imbeds one 1st-level Essence spell in an item or potion."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Charge Wand","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ChargeWand.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ChargeWand.description","level":4,"description":"Charges an Essence wand.","aoe":"1 wand","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Charger une Baguette","description":"Charge une baguette d’Essence."},"en":{"name":"Charge Wand","description":"Charges an Essence wand."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed II","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedII.description","level":5,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 2nd level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation II","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts d’Essence jusqu’au niveau 2."},"en":{"name":"Imbed II","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 2nd level."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Daily I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.DailyI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.DailyI.description","level":6,"description":"An imbedded 1st-level spell may be used once per day.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien I","description":"Un sort imprégné de niveau 1 peut être utilisé une fois par jour."},"en":{"name":"Daily I","description":"An imbedded 1st-level spell may be used once per day."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed III","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedIII.description","level":7,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 3rd level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation III","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts d’Essence jusqu’au niveau 3."},"en":{"name":"Imbed III","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 3rd level."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Charge Rod","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ChargeRod.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ChargeRod.description","level":8,"description":"As Charge Wand, but charges an Essence rod.","aoe":"1 rod","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Charger un Sceptre","description":"Comme Charger une Baguette, mais charge un sceptre d’Essence."},"en":{"name":"Charge Rod","description":"As Charge Wand, but charges an Essence rod."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed IV","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedIV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedIV.description","level":9,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 4th level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation IV","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts d’Essence jusqu’au niveau 4."},"en":{"name":"Imbed IV","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 4th level."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Daily III","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.DailyIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.DailyIII.description","level":10,"description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 3rd level; lower-level spells may receive more uses per day.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien III","description":"Crée un objet à usage quotidien utilisant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 3 ; les sorts de niveau inférieur peuvent bénéficier d’un plus grand nombre d’utilisations par jour."},"en":{"name":"Daily III","description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 3rd level; lower-level spells may receive more uses per day."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed V","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedV.description","level":11,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 5th level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation V","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts d’Essence jusqu’au niveau 5."},"en":{"name":"Imbed V","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 5th level."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Charge Staff","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ChargeStaff.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ChargeStaff.description","level":12,"description":"As Charge Wand, but charges an Essence staff.","aoe":"1 staff","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Charger un Bâton","description":"Comme Charger une Baguette, mais charge un bâton d’Essence."},"en":{"name":"Charge Staff","description":"As Charge Wand, but charges an Essence staff."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed VI","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedVI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedVI.description","level":13,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 6th level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation VI","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts d’Essence jusqu’au niveau 6."},"en":{"name":"Imbed VI","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 6th level."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Daily V","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.DailyV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.DailyV.description","level":14,"description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 5th level, with more daily uses for lower-level spells.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien V","description":"Crée un objet à usage quotidien utilisant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 5, avec davantage d’utilisations quotidiennes pour les sorts de niveau inférieur."},"en":{"name":"Daily V","description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 5th level, with more daily uses for lower-level spells."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed VII","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedVII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedVII.description","level":15,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 7th level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation VII","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts d’Essence jusqu’au niveau 7."},"en":{"name":"Imbed VII","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 7th level."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed X","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedX.description","level":20,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 10th level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation X","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts d’Essence jusqu’au niveau 10."},"en":{"name":"Imbed X","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Essence spells through 10th level."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Daily X","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.DailyX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.DailyX.description","level":25,"description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 10th level, with daily uses determined by spell level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien X","description":"Crée un objet à usage quotidien utilisant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 10, le nombre d’utilisations quotidiennes dépendant du niveau du sort."},"en":{"name":"Daily X","description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 10th level, with daily uses determined by spell level."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Constant","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.Constant.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.Constant.description","level":30,"description":"As Daily X, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Constant","description":"Comme Quotidien X, mais les effets imprégnés appropriés peuvent fonctionner en permanence, sous réserve de l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Constant","description":"As Daily X, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed True","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.ImbedTrue.description","level":50,"description":"Imbeds one Essence spell of any level in an item; the imbedded spell is normally usable once.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation Véritable","description":"Imprègne dans un objet un sort d’Essence de n’importe quel niveau ; le sort imprégné est normalement utilisable une seule fois."},"en":{"name":"Imbed True","description":"Imbeds one Essence spell of any level in an item; the imbedded spell is normally usable once."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Lord Daily","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.LordDaily.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.LordDaily.description","level":60,"description":"Creates exceptionally powerful daily-use Essence items with spells through 20th level; this is artifact-scale magic and requires GM approval.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien Seigneur","description":"Crée des objets d’Essence à usage quotidien exceptionnellement puissants, contenant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 20 ; il s’agit d’une magie de niveau artefact nécessitant l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Lord Daily","description":"Creates exceptionally powerful daily-use Essence items with spells through 20th level; this is artifact-scale magic and requires GM approval."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Lord Constant","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.LordConstant.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.LordConstant.description","level":75,"description":"As Lord Daily, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Constant Seigneur","description":"Comme Quotidien Seigneur, mais les effets imprégnés appropriés peuvent fonctionner en permanence, sous réserve de l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Lord Constant","description":"As Lord Daily, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval."}}},{"spellList":"Essence Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Daily True","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.DailyTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.EssenceImbedding.spells.DailyTrue.description","level":90,"description":"Creates daily-use Essence items with spells through 50th level; this is artifact-scale magic requiring exceptional circumstances.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien Véritable","description":"Crée des objets d’Essence à usage quotidien contenant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 50 ; il s’agit d’une magie de niveau artefact exigeant des circonstances exceptionnelles."},"en":{"name":"Daily True","description":"Creates daily-use Essence items with spells through 50th 