{"name":"Inorganic Skills","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/elements-air-earth-fire-water.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"alchemist-inorganic-skills","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Alchemy Companion","sourceList":"Inorganic Skills","sourcePage":84,"merpRealm":"Essence","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Alchemist","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"Alchemy Companion p.84 — Core-Rules Alchemist Base List; MERP/RMSS Alchemist adaptation"},"compendiumSourceKey":"alchemist-inorganic-skills","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-essence-alchemist","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Techniques Inorganiques","system":{"name":"Techniques Inorganiques","label":"Techniques Inorganiques","notesLabel":"Techniques Inorganiques — notes","notes":"<h2>Techniques Inorganiques</h2><p>Travaille pierre, métaux, alliages, gemmes et matériaux magiques. Les noms de matériaux historiques de Rolemaster sont conservés comme références techniques ; leur disponibilité en Terre du Milieu dépend du cadre de campagne et du MJ.</p><p>Les sorts ne créent pas les outils ni les matières premières nécessaires.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Inorganic Skills","system":{"name":"Inorganic Skills","label":"Inorganic Skills","notesLabel":"Inorganic Skills — notes","notes":"<h2>Inorganic Skills</h2><p>Works stone, metals, alloys, gems, and magical materials. Historical Rolemaster material names are retained as technical references; their availability in Middle-earth depends on the campaign setting and the GM.</p><p>The spells do not create the tools or raw materials required.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts d’Essence","Alchimiste (Base)"],"en":["Essence Spell Lists","Alchemist (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-essence","spell-lists-essence-alchemist"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / Alchemy Companion","name":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","realms":"Essence","profession":"Alchemist","notes":"<h2>Inorganic Skills</h2><p>Works stone, metals, alloys, gems, and magical materials. Historical Rolemaster material names are retained as technical references; their availability in Middle-earth depends on the campaign setting and the GM.</p><p>The spells do not create the tools or raw materials required.</p>","label":"Inorganic Skills","notesLabel":"Inorganic Skills — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Stone","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkStone.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkStone.description","level":1,"description":"Flawlessly works non-magical stone; alternatively grants +50 to Stone Crafts and Sculpting rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de la Pierre","description":"Travaille parfaitement la pierre non magique ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets d’Artisanat de la pierre et de Sculpture."},"en":{"name":"Work Stone","description":"Flawlessly works non-magical stone; alternatively grants +50 to Stone Crafts and Sculpting rolls."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Base Metals","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBaseMetals.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBaseMetals.description","level":2,"description":"Works ordinary base metals such as copper, tin or lead and may extract and forge them with proper equipment.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Métaux de Base","description":"Travaille les métaux de base ordinaires comme le cuivre, l’étain ou le plomb et permet de les extraire et de les forger avec l’équipement approprié."},"en":{"name":"Work Base Metals","description":"Works ordinary base metals such as copper, tin or lead and may extract and forge them with proper equipment."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Base Alloys","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBaseAlloys.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBaseAlloys.description","level":3,"description":"Works ordinary non-iron alloys such as brass, bronze and pewter with proper equipment.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Alliages de Base","description":"Travaille les alliages ordinaires sans fer comme le laiton, le bronze et l’étain avec l’équipement approprié."},"en":{"name":"Work Base Alloys","description":"Works ordinary non-iron alloys such as brass, bronze and pewter with proper equipment."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Iron","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkIron.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkIron.description","level":4,"description":"Works and forges ordinary iron; may create items of normal quality with proper equipment.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Fer","description":"Travaille et forge le fer ordinaire ; permet de créer des objets de qualité normale avec l’équipement approprié."},"en":{"name":"Work Iron","description":"Works and forges ordinary iron; may create items of normal quality with proper equipment."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Low Steel","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkLowSteel.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkLowSteel.description","level":5,"description":"Works low-carbon steel and comparable ordinary alloys, permitting items with modest superior bonuses.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Acier Doux","description":"Travaille l’acier à faible teneur en carbone et les alliages ordinaires comparables, permettant de produire des objets bénéficiant de modestes bonus supérieurs."},"en":{"name":"Work Low Steel","description":"Works low-carbon steel and comparable ordinary alloys, permitting items with modest superior bonuses."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work High Steel","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkHighSteel.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkHighSteel.description","level":6,"description":"Works high-carbon steel and comparable superior ordinary alloys.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Acier Dur","description":"Travaille l’acier à forte teneur en carbone et les alliages ordinaires supérieurs comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work High Steel","description":"Works high-carbon steel and comparable superior ordinary alloys."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Keron","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkKeron.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkKeron.description","level":7,"description":"Works magical alloys such as Keron when the necessary ingredients, tools and knowledge are available.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Keron","description":"Travaille les alliages magiques comme le Keron lorsque les ingrédients, outils et connaissances nécessaires sont disponibles."},"en":{"name":"Work Keron","description":"Works magical alloys such as Keron when the necessary ingredients, tools and knowledge are available."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Precious Metals","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkPreciousMetals.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkPreciousMetals.description","level":8,"description":"Works precious metals such as silver and gold and alloys made from them.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Métaux Précieux","description":"Travaille les métaux précieux comme l’argent et l’or ainsi que les alliages qui en sont issus."},"en":{"name":"Work Precious Metals","description":"Works precious metals such as silver and gold and alloys made from them."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work White Steel","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkWhiteSteel.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkWhiteSteel.description","level":9,"description":"Works superior white-steel alloys and comparable non-magical alloys.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Acier Blanc","description":"Travaille les alliages supérieurs d’acier blanc et les alliages non magiques comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work White Steel","description":"Works superior white-steel alloys and comparable non-magical alloys."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Mithin","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithin.description","level":10,"description":"Works Mithin (beryllium) and comparable high-quality non-magical metals.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Mithin","description":"Travaille le Mithin (béryllium) et les métaux non magiques de haute qualité comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work Mithin","description":"Works Mithin (beryllium) and comparable high-quality non-magical metals."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Gemstone","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkGemstone.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkGemstone.description","level":11,"description":"Cuts, facets and polishes non-magical gemstones; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate gem-cutting or jeweler rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Gemmes","description":"Taille, facette et polit les gemmes non magiques ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets appropriés de taille de gemmes ou de Joaillerie."},"en":{"name":"Work Gemstone","description":"Cuts, facets and polishes non-magical gemstones; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate gem-cutting or jeweler rolls."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Black Steel","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBlackSteel.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBlackSteel.description","level":12,"description":"Works black-steel alloys and comparable superior non-magical alloys.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Acier Noir","description":"Travaille les alliages d’acier noir et les alliages non magiques supérieurs comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work Black Steel","description":"Works black-steel alloys and comparable superior non-magical alloys."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Mithglin","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithglin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithglin.description","level":13,"description":"Works Mithglin (titanium) and comparable superior non-magical metals.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Mithglin","description":"Travaille le Mithglin (titane) et les métaux non magiques supérieurs comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work Mithglin","description":"Works Mithglin (titanium) and comparable superior non-magical metals."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Ithilnaur","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkIthilnaur.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkIthilnaur.description","level":14,"description":"Works magical Ithilnaur (moon-fire) and comparable magical alloys.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Ithilnaur","description":"Travaille l’Ithilnaur magique (feu-de-lune) et les alliages magiques comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work Ithilnaur","description":"Works magical Ithilnaur (moon-fire) and comparable magical alloys."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Mithril","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithril.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithril.description","level":15,"description":"Works magical Mithril (True-silver) when proper tools, material and facilities are available.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Mithril","description":"Travaille le Mithril magique (Vrai-Argent) lorsque les outils, matériaux et installations appropriés sont disponibles."},"en":{"name":"Work Mithril","description":"Works magical Mithril (True-silver) when proper tools, material and facilities are available."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Laen","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkLaen.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkLaen.description","level":20,"description":"Works magical Laen and other materials of comparable potency.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Laen","description":"Travaille le Laen magique et les autres matériaux d’une puissance comparable."},"en":{"name":"Work Laen","description":"Works magical Laen and other materials of comparable potency."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Eog","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkEog.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkEog.description","level":25,"description":"Works magical Eog and alloys of comparable potency.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Eog","description":"Travaille l’Eog magique et les alliages d’une puissance comparable."},"en":{"name":"Work Eog","description":"Works magical Eog and alloys of comparable potency."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Galvorn","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkGalvorn.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkGalvorn.description","level":30,"description":"Works magical Galvorn and materials of comparable potency.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Galvorn","description":"Travaille le Galvorn magique et les matériaux d’une puissance comparable."},"en":{"name":"Work Galvorn","description":"Works magical Galvorn and materials of comparable potency."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Angil","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkAngil.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkAngil.description","level":35,"description":"Works magical Angil (star-iron) and materials of comparable potency.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Angil","description":"Travaille l’Angil magique (fer-étoile) et les matériaux d’une puissance comparable."},"en":{"name":"Work Angil","description":"Works magical Angil (star-iron) and materials of comparable potency."}}},{"spellList":"Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work True","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkTrue.description","level":50,"description":"May make and work any metal, alloy or inorganic mineral, including materials with exceptional anti-magical properties, subject to tools and materials.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail Véritable","description":"Permet de fabriquer et de travailler n’importe quel métal, alliage ou minéral inorganique, y compris les matériaux possédant des propriétés anti-magiques exceptionnelles, sous réserve de disposer des outils et matériaux nécessaires."},"en":{"name":"Work True","description":"May make and work any metal, alloy or inorganic mineral, including materials with exceptional anti-magical properties, subject to tools and materials."}}}]},"_id":"vFsrCw5NboEkVEiD"}
{"name":"Liquid/Gas Skills","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/elements-air-earth-fire-water.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"alchemist-liquid-gas-skills","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Alchemy Companion","sourceList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","sourcePage":85,"merpRealm":"Essence","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Alchemist","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"Alchemy Companion p.85 — Core-Rules Alchemist Base List; MERP/RMSS Alchemist adaptation"},"compendiumSourceKey":"alchemist-liquid-gas-skills","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-essence-alchemist","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Techniques des Liquides et Gaz","system":{"name":"Techniques des Liquides et Gaz","label":"Techniques des Liquides et Gaz","notesLabel":"Techniques des Liquides et Gaz — notes","notes":"<h2>Techniques des Liquides et Gaz</h2><p>Prépare liquides, gaz, poisons et potions et permet d’y intégrer des sorts grâce aux Listes d’Imbedding. Plusieurs sorts couvrent des domaines voisins ; les bonus alternatifs aux Compétences ne doivent pas être cumulés.</p><p>Les sorts source de niveau 100 et 120 ne sont pas inclus dans cette première conversion RMU.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Liquid/Gas Skills","system":{"name":"Liquid/Gas Skills","label":"Liquid/Gas Skills","notesLabel":"Liquid/Gas Skills — notes","notes":"<h2>Liquid/Gas Skills</h2><p>Prepares liquids, gases, poisons, and potions and allows spells to be incorporated into them through the Imbedding Lists. Several spells cover related fields; alternative Skill bonuses must not be cumulative.</p><p>Source spells of levels 100 and 120 are not included in this first RMU conversion.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts d’Essence","Alchimiste (Base)"],"en":["Essence Spell Lists","Alchemist (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-essence","spell-lists-essence-alchemist"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / Alchemy Companion","name":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","realms":"Essence","profession":"Alchemist","notes":"<h2>Liquid/Gas Skills</h2><p>Prepares liquids, gases, poisons, and potions and allows spells to be incorporated into them through the Imbedding Lists. Several spells cover related fields; alternative Skill bonuses must not be cumulative.</p><p>Source spells of levels 100 and 120 are not included in this first RMU conversion.</p>","label":"Liquid/Gas Skills","notesLabel":"Liquid/Gas Skills — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Liquid","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkLiquid.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkLiquid.description","level":1,"description":"Flawlessly works non-magical liquids; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Alchemy, brewing, distilling or winery rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Liquides","description":"Travaille parfaitement les liquides non magiques ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets appropriés d’Alchimie, de Brassage, de Distillation ou de Vinification."},"en":{"name":"Work Liquid","description":"Flawlessly works non-magical liquids; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Alchemy, brewing, distilling or winery rolls."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Poison I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonI.description","level":2,"description":"Safely handles, prepares and processes poisons with attacks up to 1st level; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate poison skills.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poison I","description":"Manipule, prépare et traite sans danger les poisons dont l’attaque ne dépasse pas le niveau 1 ; peut également conférer +50 aux Compétences appropriées liées aux poisons."},"en":{"name":"Poison I","description":"Safely handles, prepares and processes poisons with attacks up to 1st level; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate poison skills."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Potion I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionI.description","level":3,"description":"Creates one dose of potion capable of holding one imbedded 1st-level spell.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion I","description":"Crée une dose de potion pouvant contenir un sort imprégné de niveau 1."},"en":{"name":"Potion I","description":"Creates one dose of potion capable of holding one imbedded 1st-level spell."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Poison III","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonIII.description","level":4,"description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 3rd level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poison III","description":"Comme Poison I, mais permet de traiter des poisons jusqu’au niveau 3."},"en":{"name":"Poison III","description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 3rd level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Gas","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkGas.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkGas.description","level":5,"description":"Flawlessly works non-magical gases; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Alchemy rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Gaz","description":"Travaille parfaitement les gaz non magiques ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets d’Alchimie appropriés."},"en":{"name":"Work Gas","description":"Flawlessly works non-magical gases; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Alchemy rolls."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Potion II","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionII.description","level":6,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 2nd level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion II","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 2."},"en":{"name":"Potion II","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 2nd level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Poison VI","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonVI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonVI.description","level":7,"description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 6th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poison VI","description":"Comme Poison I, mais permet de traiter des poisons jusqu’au niveau 6."},"en":{"name":"Poison VI","description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 6th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Potion III","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionIII.description","level":9,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 3rd level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion III","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 3."},"en":{"name":"Potion III","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 3rd level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Poison X","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonX.description","level":10,"description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 10th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poison X","description":"Comme Poison I, mais permet de traiter des poisons jusqu’au niveau 10."},"en":{"name":"Poison X","description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 10th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Magical Liquid","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkMagicalLiquid.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkMagicalLiquid.description","level":11,"description":"As Work Liquid, but works magical liquids and may attempt to combine multiple magical effects, subject to magic-interaction rules.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Liquides Magiques","description":"Comme Travail des Liquides, mais permet de travailler les liquides magiques et de tenter de combiner plusieurs effets magiques, sous réserve des règles d’interaction magique."},"en":{"name":"Work Magical Liquid","description":"As Work Liquid, but works magical liquids and may attempt to combine multiple magical effects, subject to magic-interaction rules."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Potion IV","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionIV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionIV.description","level":12,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 4th level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion IV","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 4."},"en":{"name":"Potion IV","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 4th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Gaseous Potion","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.GaseousPotion.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.GaseousPotion.description","level":13,"description":"When cast immediately before a Potion spell, creates a gaseous potion released into the air; beings in the affected area may receive an RR as determined by the source rules.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion Gazeuse","description":"Lancé immédiatement avant un sort de Potion, crée une potion gazeuse libérée dans l’air ; les êtres présents dans la zone affectée peuvent bénéficier d’un JR selon les règles d’origine."},"en":{"name":"Gaseous Potion","description":"When cast immediately before a Potion spell, creates a gaseous potion released into the air; beings in the affected area may receive an RR as determined by the source rules."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Magical Gas","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkMagicalGas.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkMagicalGas.description","level":14,"description":"As Work Gas, but works magical gases and may attempt to combine multiple magical effects.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Gaz Magiques","description":"Comme Travail des Gaz, mais permet de travailler les gaz magiques et de tenter de combiner plusieurs effets magiques."},"en":{"name":"Work Magical Gas","description":"As Work Gas, but works magical gases and may attempt to combine multiple magical effects."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Potion V","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionV.description","level":15,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 5th level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion V","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 5."},"en":{"name":"Potion V","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 5th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Potion VII","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionVII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionVII.description","level":20,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 7th level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion VII","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 7."},"en":{"name":"Potion VII","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 7th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Potion X","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionX.description","level":25,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 10th level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion X","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 10."},"en":{"name":"Potion X","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 10th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Multiple Doses","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.MultipleDoses.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.MultipleDoses.description","level":30,"description":"Allows a Potion spell to create several doses by dividing the available spell-level capacity among them.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Doses Multiples","description":"Permet à un sort de Potion de créer plusieurs doses en répartissant entre elles la capacité disponible en niveaux de sort."},"en":{"name":"Multiple Doses","description":"Allows a Potion spell to create several doses by dividing the available spell-level capacity among them."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Poisons True","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonsTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonsTrue.description","level":40,"description":"Safely works poisons of any level or magical nature.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poisons Véritables","description":"Permet de travailler sans danger des poisons de n’importe quel niveau ou de nature magique."},"en":{"name":"Poisons True","description":"Safely works poisons of any level or magical nature."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Lord Potion","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.LordPotion.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.LordPotion.description","level":50,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 20th level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion Seigneur","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 20."},"en":{"name":"Lord Potion","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 20th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Potion XXX","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionXXX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionXXX.description","level":75,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 30th level. This is optional artifact-scale magic requiring exceptional circumstances.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion XXX","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 30. Il s’agit d’une magie optionnelle de niveau artefact exigeant des circonstances exceptionnelles."},"en":{"name":"Potion XXX","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 30th level. This is optional artifact-scale magic requiring exceptional circumstances."}}}]},"_id":"IkAK2VnVJd48ROTZ"}
{"name":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/elements-air-earth-fire-water.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"alchemist-mentalism-channeling-imbedding","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Alchemy Companion","sourceList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","sourcePage":80,"merpRealm":"Essence","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Alchemist","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"Alchemy Companion p.80 — Core-Rules Alchemist Base List; MERP/RMSS Alchemist adaptation"},"compendiumSourceKey":"alchemist-mentalism-channeling-imbedding","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-essence-alchemist","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation Mentalisme/Théurgie","system":{"name":"Imprégnation Mentalisme/Théurgie","label":"Imprégnation Mentalisme/Théurgie","notesLabel":"Imprégnation Mentalisme/Théurgie — notes","notes":"<h2>Imprégnation Mentalisme/Théurgie</h2><p>Permet à l’Alchimiste d’imprégner des sorts de Mentalisme ou de Canalisation. Le lanceur doit disposer d’un accès réel au sort concerné — par exemple grâce à un autre lanceur, une rune, un symbole ou une tradition religieuse appropriée.</p><p>Les sorts source au-delà du niveau 90 sont réservés pour une conversion ultérieure.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","system":{"name":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","label":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","notesLabel":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding — notes","notes":"<h2>Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding</h2><p>Allows the Alchemist to imbed Mentalism or Channeling spells. The caster must have genuine access to the spell concerned—for example through another caster, a rune, a symbol, or an appropriate religious tradition.</p><p>Source spells above level 90 are reserved for a later conversion.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts d’Essence","Alchimiste (Base)"],"en":["Essence Spell Lists","Alchemist (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-essence","spell-lists-essence-alchemist"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / Alchemy Companion","name":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","realms":"Essence","profession":"Alchemist","notes":"<h2>Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding</h2><p>Allows the Alchemist to imbed Mentalism or Channeling spells. The caster must have genuine access to the spell concerned—for example through another caster, a rune, a symbol, or an appropriate religious tradition.</p><p>Source spells above level 90 are reserved for a later conversion.</p>","label":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","notesLabel":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Research","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.Research.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.Research.description","level":1,"description":"Researches special imbedding spells for item creation; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Spell Research and/or Item Creation rolls concerning Mentalism or Channeling imbedding.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Recherche","description":"Recherche des sorts d’imprégnation spéciaux destinés à la création d’objets ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets appropriés de Recherche de Sorts et/ou de Création d’Objets concernant l’imprégnation du Mentalisme ou de la Théurgie."},"en":{"name":"Research","description":"Researches special imbedding spells for item creation; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Spell Research and/or Item Creation rolls concerning Mentalism or Channeling imbedding."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedI.description","level":3,"description":"Imbeds one 1st-level Mentalism or Channeling spell in an item or potion. The caster must have access to the spell being imbedded.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation I","description":"Imprègne dans un objet ou une potion un sort de Mentalisme ou de Théurgie de niveau 1. Le lanceur doit avoir accès au sort à imprégner."},"en":{"name":"Imbed I","description":"Imbeds one 1st-level Mentalism or Channeling spell in an item or potion. The caster must have access to the spell being imbedded."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Charge Wand","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ChargeWand.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ChargeWand.description","level":5,"description":"Charges a Mentalism or Channeling wand when the caster has access to the appropriate spell.","aoe":"1 wand","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Charger une Baguette","description":"Charge une baguette de Mentalisme ou de Théurgie lorsque le lanceur a accès au sort approprié."},"en":{"name":"Charge Wand","description":"Charges a Mentalism or Channeling wand when the caster has access to the appropriate spell."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed II","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedII.description","level":6,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 2nd level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation II","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts jusqu’au niveau 2."},"en":{"name":"Imbed II","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 2nd level."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Daily I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.DailyI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.DailyI.description","level":7,"description":"An imbedded 1st-level spell may be used once per day.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien I","description":"Un sort imprégné de niveau 1 peut être utilisé une fois par jour."},"en":{"name":"Daily I","description":"An imbedded 1st-level spell may be used once per day."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed III","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedIII.description","level":9,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 3rd level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation III","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts jusqu’au niveau 3."},"en":{"name":"Imbed III","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 3rd level."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Charge Rod","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ChargeRod.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ChargeRod.description","level":10,"description":"As Charge Wand, but charges a rod.","aoe":"1 rod","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Charger un Sceptre","description":"Comme Charger une Baguette, mais charge un sceptre."},"en":{"name":"Charge Rod","description":"As Charge Wand, but charges a rod."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Daily III","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.DailyIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.DailyIII.description","level":11,"description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 3rd level; lower-level spells may receive more uses per day.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien III","description":"Crée un objet à usage quotidien utilisant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 3 ; les sorts de niveau inférieur peuvent bénéficier d’un plus grand nombre d’utilisations par jour."},"en":{"name":"Daily III","description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 3rd level; lower-level spells may receive more uses per day."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed IV","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedIV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedIV.description","level":12,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 4th level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation IV","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts jusqu’au niveau 4."},"en":{"name":"Imbed IV","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 4th level."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed V","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedV.description","level":14,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 5th level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation V","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts jusqu’au niveau 5."},"en":{"name":"Imbed V","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 5th level."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Daily V","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.DailyV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.DailyV.description","level":15,"description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 5th level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien V","description":"Crée un objet à usage quotidien utilisant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 5."},"en":{"name":"Daily V","description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 5th level."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Charge Staff","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ChargeStaff.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ChargeStaff.description","level":20,"description":"As Charge Wand, but charges a staff.","aoe":"1 staff","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Charger un Bâton","description":"Comme Charger une Baguette, mais charge un bâton."},"en":{"name":"Charge Staff","description":"As Charge Wand, but charges a staff."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed X","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedX.description","level":25,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 10th level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation X","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts jusqu’au niveau 10."},"en":{"name":"Imbed X","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 10th level."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Daily X","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.DailyX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.DailyX.description","level":30,"description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 10th level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien X","description":"Crée un objet à usage quotidien utilisant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 10."},"en":{"name":"Daily X","description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 10th level."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Constant","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.Constant.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.Constant.description","level":50,"description":"As Daily X, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Constant","description":"Comme Quotidien X, mais les effets imprégnés appropriés peuvent fonctionner en permanence, sous réserve de l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Constant","description":"As Daily X, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Imbed True","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.ImbedTrue.description","level":60,"description":"Imbeds one Mentalism or Channeling spell of any level in an item; it is normally usable once.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation Véritable","description":"Imprègne dans un objet un sort de Mentalisme ou de Théurgie de n’importe quel niveau ; il est normalement utilisable une seule fois."},"en":{"name":"Imbed True","description":"Imbeds one Mentalism or Channeling spell of any level in an item; it is normally usable once."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Lord Daily","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.LordDaily.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.LordDaily.description","level":75,"description":"Creates exceptionally powerful daily-use items with spells through 20th level; artifact-scale and GM-controlled.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien Seigneur","description":"Crée des objets à usage quotidien exceptionnellement puissants, contenant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 20 ; il s’agit d’une magie de niveau artefact placée sous le contrôle du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Lord Daily","description":"Creates exceptionally powerful daily-use items with spells through 20th level; artifact-scale and GM-controlled."}}},{"spellList":"Mentalism/Channeling Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Lord Constant","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.LordConstant.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.MentalismChannelingImbedding.spells.LordConstant.description","level":90,"description":"As Lord Daily, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Constant Seigneur","description":"Comme Quotidien Seigneur, mais les effets imprégnés appropriés peuvent fonctionner en permanence, sous réserve de l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Lord Constant","description":"As Lord Daily, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval."}}}]},"_id":"2KYuN4akP2HwlnYg"}
{"name":"Organic Skills","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/elements-air-earth-fire-water.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"alchemist-organic-skills","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Alchemy Companion","sourceList":"Organic Skills","sourcePage":83,"merpRealm":"Essence","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Alchemist","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"Alchemy Companion p.83 — Core-Rules Alchemist Base List; MERP/RMSS Alchemist adaptation"},"compendiumSourceKey":"alchemist-organic-skills","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-essence-alchemist","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Techniques Organiques","system":{"name":"Techniques Organiques","label":"Techniques Organiques","notesLabel":"Techniques Organiques — notes","notes":"<h2>Techniques Organiques</h2><p>Travaille tissus, cuir, bois et autres matières organiques et crée les supports physiques nécessaires à de nombreux objets alchimiques. Le papier runique est réutilisable après déclenchement, mais ne peut porter qu’un seul sort à la fois.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Organic Skills","system":{"name":"Organic Skills","label":"Organic Skills","notesLabel":"Organic Skills — notes","notes":"<h2>Organic Skills</h2><p>Works cloth, leather, wood, and other organic materials and creates the physical supports required by many alchemical items. Runic paper is reusable after activation, but can carry only one spell at a time.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts d’Essence","Alchimiste (Base)"],"en":["Essence Spell Lists","Alchemist (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-essence","spell-lists-essence-alchemist"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / Alchemy Companion","name":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","realms":"Essence","profession":"Alchemist","notes":"<h2>Organic Skills</h2><p>Works cloth, leather, wood, and other organic materials and creates the physical supports required by many alchemical items. Runic paper is reusable after activation, but can carry only one spell at a time.</p>","label":"Organic Skills","notesLabel":"Organic Skills — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Cloth","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkCloth.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkCloth.description","level":1,"description":"Flawlessly fabricates and works non-magical cloth when the required tools and materials are available; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate textile Crafting rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Tissu","description":"Fabrique et travaille parfaitement un tissu non magique lorsque les outils et matériaux requis sont disponibles ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets d’Artisanat textile appropriés."},"en":{"name":"Work Cloth","description":"Flawlessly fabricates and works non-magical cloth when the required tools and materials are available; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate textile Crafting rolls."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Leather","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkLeather.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkLeather.description","level":2,"description":"Creates and works non-magical leather, parchment and vellum; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate leatherworking Crafting rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Cuir","description":"Crée et travaille parfaitement le cuir, le parchemin et le vélin non magiques ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets d’Artisanat du cuir appropriés."},"en":{"name":"Work Leather","description":"Creates and works non-magical leather, parchment and vellum; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate leatherworking Crafting rolls."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Wood","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkWood.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkWood.description","level":3,"description":"Flawlessly works non-magical wood; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate woodworking Crafting rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Bois","description":"Travaille parfaitement le bois non magique ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets d’Artisanat du bois appropriés."},"en":{"name":"Work Wood","description":"Flawlessly works non-magical wood; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate woodworking Crafting rolls."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Rune Paper I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperI.description","level":4,"description":"Creates reusable rune paper able to hold one 1st-level spell; also permits flawless paper making and related crafts.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique I","description":"Crée un papier runique réutilisable pouvant contenir un sort de niveau 1 ; permet également de fabriquer parfaitement le papier et d’effectuer des travaux apparentés."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper I","description":"Creates reusable rune paper able to hold one 1st-level spell; also permits flawless paper making and related crafts."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Organic","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkOrganic.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkOrganic.description","level":5,"description":"As Work Cloth, but may work any ordinary non-magical organic material such as horn, bone, chitin, wax, feathers or hair.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail Organique","description":"Comme Travail du Tissu, mais permet de travailler toute matière organique ordinaire non magique, comme la corne, l’os, la chitine, la cire, les plumes ou les cheveux."},"en":{"name":"Work Organic","description":"As Work Cloth, but may work any ordinary non-magical organic material such as horn, bone, chitin, wax, feathers or hair."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Rune Paper II","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperII.description","level":6,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 2nd level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique II","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 2."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper II","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 2nd level."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Make Wand","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeWand.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeWand.description","level":7,"description":"Creates a wand suitable for receiving imbedded spells.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Fabriquer une Baguette","description":"Crée une baguette adaptée à recevoir des sorts imprégnés."},"en":{"name":"Make Wand","description":"Creates a wand suitable for receiving imbedded spells."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Rune Paper III","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperIII.description","level":8,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 3rd level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique III","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 3."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper III","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 3rd level."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Make Rod","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeRod.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeRod.description","level":10,"description":"Creates a rod suitable for receiving imbedded spells.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Fabriquer un Sceptre","description":"Crée un sceptre adapté à recevoir des sorts imprégnés."},"en":{"name":"Make Rod","description":"Creates a rod suitable for receiving imbedded spells."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Rune Paper V","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperV.description","level":11,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 5th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique V","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 5."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper V","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 5th level."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Organic Rune","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.OrganicRune.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.OrganicRune.description","level":13,"description":"When cast immediately before a Rune Paper spell, allows the rune to be placed on a non-living organic material instead of paper.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Rune Organique","description":"Lancé immédiatement avant un sort de Papier Runique, permet de placer la rune sur une matière organique non vivante plutôt que sur du papier."},"en":{"name":"Organic Rune","description":"When cast immediately before a Rune Paper spell, allows the rune to be placed on a non-living organic material instead of paper."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Rune Paper VII","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperVII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperVII.description","level":14,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 7th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique VII","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 7."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper VII","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 7th level."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Make Staff","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeStaff.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeStaff.description","level":15,"description":"Creates a staff suitable for receiving imbedded spells.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Fabriquer un Bâton","description":"Crée un bâton adapté à recevoir des sorts imprégnés."},"en":{"name":"Make Staff","description":"Creates a staff suitable for receiving imbedded spells."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Rune Paper X","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperX.description","level":16,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 10th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique X","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 10."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper X","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 10th level."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Magic Cloth","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicCloth.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicCloth.description","level":17,"description":"As Work Cloth, but may create or work magical cloth.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Tissu Magique","description":"Comme Travail du Tissu, mais permet de créer ou de travailler du tissu magique."},"en":{"name":"Work Magic Cloth","description":"As Work Cloth, but may create or work magical cloth."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Magic Leather","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicLeather.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicLeather.description","level":18,"description":"As Work Leather, but may create or work magical leather.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Cuir Magique","description":"Comme Travail du Cuir, mais permet de créer ou de travailler du cuir magique."},"en":{"name":"Work Magic Leather","description":"As Work Leather, but may create or work magical leather."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Magic Wood","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicWood.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicWood.description","level":19,"description":"As Work Wood, but may create or work magical wood.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Bois Magique","description":"Comme Travail du Bois, mais permet de créer ou de travailler du bois magique."},"en":{"name":"Work Magic Wood","description":"As Work Wood, but may create or work magical wood."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Work Organic True","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkOrganicTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkOrganicTrue.description","level":20,"description":"May create or work extraordinary or magical organic materials, such as dragon hide, when proper tools and materials are available.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail Organique Véritable","description":"Permet de créer ou de travailler des matières organiques extraordinaires ou magiques, comme la peau de dragon, lorsque les outils et matériaux appropriés sont disponibles."},"en":{"name":"Work Organic True","description":"May create or work extraordinary or magical organic materials, such as dragon hide, when proper tools and materials are available."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Lord Rune Paper","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.LordRunePaper.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.LordRunePaper.description","level":25,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 20th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique Seigneur","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 20."},"en":{"name":"Lord Rune Paper","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 20th level."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Rune Paper XXX","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperXXX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperXXX.description","level":30,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 30th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique XXX","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 30."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper XXX","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 30th level."}}},{"spellList":"Organic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Alchemist","name":"Rune Paper True","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperTrue.description","level":50,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but may hold a spell of any level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique Véritable","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort de n’importe quel niveau."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper True","description":"As Rune Paper I, but may hold a spell of any level."}}}]},"_id":"Xp1Zkv5UKu5HzJvk"}
{"name":"Nature's Movement/Senses","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-horned-white-purple.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"animist-natures-movement-senses","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Spell Law","sourceList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","sourcePage":32,"merpRealm":"Channeling","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Animist","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"RMSS Spell Law p.32 — Animist Base List 2.3.4; MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5 — Animist"},"compendiumSourceKey":"animist-natures-movement-senses","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-channeling-animist","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Mouvements et Sens de la Nature","system":{"name":"Mouvements et Sens de la Nature","label":"Mouvements et Sens de la Nature","notesLabel":"Mouvements et Sens de la Nature — notes","notes":"<h2>Mouvements et Sens de la Nature</h2><p>Liste de base de l’Animiste conservée depuis RMSS pour MERP-RMU. Elle améliore les sens, la mobilité, la résistance et certaines capacités physiques du lanceur en empruntant des qualités animales.</p><p><strong>Note :</strong> sauf Peau de Caméléon, Griffes de Lion et Croc de Vipère, les sorts de cette Liste ne modifient pas physiquement l’apparence du lanceur.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Nature's Movement/Senses","system":{"name":"Nature's Movement/Senses","label":"Nature's Movement/Senses","notesLabel":"Nature's Movement/Senses — notes","notes":"<h2>Nature's Movement/Senses</h2><p>Animist Base List retained from RMSS for MERP-RMU. It enhances the caster's senses, mobility, resistance, and certain physical capabilities by borrowing animal qualities.</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> except for Chameleon Skin, Lion Claws, and Viperfang, spells from this List do not physically alter the caster's appearance.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Théurgie","Animiste (Base)"],"en":["Channeling Spell Lists","Animist (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-channeling","spell-lists-channeling-animist"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / RMSS Spell Law","name":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","realms":"Channeling","profession":"Animist","notes":"<h2>Nature's Movement/Senses</h2><p>Animist Base List retained from RMSS for MERP-RMU. It enhances the caster's senses, mobility, resistance, and certain physical capabilities by borrowing animal qualities.</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> except for Chameleon Skin, Lion Claws, and Viperfang, spells from this List do not physically alter the caster's appearance.</p>","label":"Nature's Movement/Senses","notesLabel":"Nature's Movement/Senses — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Cat Step","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Cat Step.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Cat Step.description","level":1,"description":"Caster moves as quietly as a cat and gains +20 to all Stalking maneuvers.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pas de Chat","description":"Le lanceur se déplace aussi silencieusement qu’un chat et gagne +20 à toutes les Manœuvres de Filature."},"en":{"name":"Cat Step","description":"Caster moves as quietly as a cat and gains +20 to all Stalking maneuvers."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Chameleon Skin","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Chameleon Skin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Chameleon Skin.description","level":2,"description":"Caster’s skin takes on the coloration of the surrounding terrain, granting +10 to +50 to Stalking/Hiding maneuvers. The coloration changes to match surrounding terrain but does not affect gear or clothing.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Peau de Caméléon","description":"La peau du lanceur adopte la coloration du terrain environnant, conférant de +10 à +50 aux Manœuvres de Filature/Dissimulation. La coloration s’adapte au décor, mais n’affecte ni l’équipement ni les vêtements."},"en":{"name":"Chameleon Skin","description":"Caster’s skin takes on the coloration of the surrounding terrain, granting +10 to +50 to Stalking/Hiding maneuvers. The coloration changes to match surrounding terrain but does not affect gear or clothing."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Wolf Sense","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Wolf Sense.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Wolf Sense.description","level":3,"description":"Caster gains an increased sense of smell and hearing, including subtle smells and higher sonic ranges. This gives +50 to Perception using only these senses and +20 when combined with other senses.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens du Loup","description":"Le lanceur bénéficie d’un odorat et d’une ouïe accrus, notamment pour les odeurs subtiles et les fréquences sonores élevées. Il gagne +50 à la Perception utilisant uniquement ces sens et +20 lorsqu’ils sont combinés à d’autres sens."},"en":{"name":"Wolf Sense","description":"Caster gains an increased sense of smell and hearing, including subtle smells and higher sonic ranges. This gives +50 to Perception using only these senses and +20 when combined with other senses."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Deer Speed I","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed I.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed I.description","level":4,"description":"Caster can run at twice normal pace (Run pace) while expending exhaustion as if only walking.","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vitesse du Cerf I","description":"Le lanceur peut courir à deux fois son allure normale (allure Course) tout en dépensant de l’Endurance comme s’il marchait."},"en":{"name":"Deer Speed I","description":"Caster can run at twice normal pace (Run pace) while expending exhaustion as if only walking."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Bat Sense","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bat Sense.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bat Sense.description","level":5,"description":"Caster can maneuver more effectively without sight. When blinded or otherwise without sight, the spell reduces darkness/blindness maneuver penalties by +10 to +50; it does not remove blindness.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens de la Chauve-souris","description":"Le lanceur peut manœuvrer plus efficacement sans la vue. Lorsqu’il est aveuglé ou privé de vision, le sort réduit de 10 à 50 points les pénalités de Manœuvre dues à l’obscurité ou à la cécité ; il ne supprime pas la cécité."},"en":{"name":"Bat Sense","description":"Caster can maneuver more effectively without sight. When blinded or otherwise without sight, the spell reduces darkness/blindness maneuver penalties by +10 to +50; it does not remove blindness."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Otterlungs","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Otterlungs.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Otterlungs.description","level":6,"description":"Caster can safely hold breath for the duration of the spell.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poumons de Loutre","description":"Le lanceur peut retenir sa respiration sans danger pendant toute la durée du sort."},"en":{"name":"Otterlungs","description":"Caster can safely hold breath for the duration of the spell."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Glide I","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide I.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide I.description","level":7,"description":"Caster can glide like a bird. The product of altitude and horizontal speed cannot exceed 100 feet per round; the caster cannot choose a total less than or greater than 100.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Plané I","description":"Le lanceur peut planer comme un oiseau. Le produit de l’altitude et de la vitesse horizontale ne peut dépasser 100 pieds par round ; le lanceur ne peut choisir un total inférieur ou supérieur à 100."},"en":{"name":"Glide I","description":"Caster can glide like a bird. The product of altitude and horizontal speed cannot exceed 100 feet per round; the caster cannot choose a total less than or greater than 100."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Hawk's Sense","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Hawk's Sense.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Hawk's Sense.description","level":8,"description":"Caster gains the visual acuity of a hawk, granting +50 to Perception involving only sight and +20 when sight is combined with other senses.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens du Faucon","description":"Le lanceur bénéficie de l’acuité visuelle d’un faucon, gagnant +50 à la Perception fondée uniquement sur la vue et +20 lorsque la vue est combinée à d’autres sens."},"en":{"name":"Hawk's Sense","description":"Caster gains the visual acuity of a hawk, granting +50 to Perception involving only sight and +20 when sight is combined with other senses."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Tiger Skin","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Tiger Skin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Tiger Skin.description","level":9,"description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a large cat, equivalent to Armor Type 3.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Peau de Tigre","description":"La peau du lanceur acquiert la résistance d’un grand félin, équivalente à un Type d’Armure 3."},"en":{"name":"Tiger Skin","description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a large cat, equivalent to Armor Type 3."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Boar Strength","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Boar Strength.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Boar Strength.description","level":10,"description":"Caster gains the force of a wild boar, receiving +20 melee OB but unable to parry or use missile weapons for the duration.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Force du Sanglier","description":"Le lanceur acquiert la puissance d’un sanglier sauvage et reçoit +20 BO en mêlée, mais ne peut ni parer ni utiliser d’armes de projectile pendant la durée du sort."},"en":{"name":"Boar Strength","description":"Caster gains the force of a wild boar, receiving +20 melee OB but unable to parry or use missile weapons for the duration."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Lion Claws","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Lion Claws.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Lion Claws.description","level":11,"description":"Caster can make claw attacks as a lion, using the Claw Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Striking.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Griffes de Lion","description":"Le lanceur peut attaquer avec des griffes comme un lion, en utilisant la Table d’Attaque de Griffes avec un maximum de résultats Moyens. Cette attaque nécessite une Compétence développée séparément, comparable aux Arts Martiaux — Frappes."},"en":{"name":"Lion Claws","description":"Caster can make claw attacks as a lion, using the Claw Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Striking."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Insect Sense","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Insect Sense.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Insect Sense.description","level":12,"description":"Caster gains an insect-like sensitivity to vibrations through the ground or other solid material within the area. The spell indicates general movement and approximate number of targets and grants +25 to +100 to appropriate Perception maneuvers depending on activity.","aoe":"10'R/lvl","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens de l’Insecte","description":"Le lanceur acquiert une sensibilité de type insecte aux vibrations transmises par le sol ou un autre matériau solide dans la zone. Le sort indique les mouvements généraux et le nombre approximatif de cibles et confère de +25 à +100 aux Manœuvres de Perception appropriées selon l’activité."},"en":{"name":"Insect Sense","description":"Caster gains an insect-like sensitivity to vibrations through the ground or other solid material within the area. The spell indicates general movement and approximate number of targets and grants +25 to +100 to appropriate Perception maneuvers depending on activity."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Deer Speed II","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed II.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed II.description","level":13,"description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to three times normal pace (Sprint pace).","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vitesse du Cerf II","description":"Comme Vitesse du Cerf I, mais la vitesse passe à trois fois l’allure normale (allure Sprint)."},"en":{"name":"Deer Speed II","description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to three times normal pace (Sprint pace)."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Bear Skin","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bear Skin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bear Skin.description","level":14,"description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a bear, equivalent to Armor Type 8.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Peau d’Ours","description":"La peau du lanceur acquiert la résistance d’un ours, équivalente à un Type d’Armure 8."},"en":{"name":"Bear Skin","description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a bear, equivalent to Armor Type 8."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Bear Arms","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bear Arms.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bear Arms.description","level":15,"description":"Caster can make grapple attacks as a bear, using the Grapple Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Sweeps/Throws.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Bras d’Ours","description":"Le lanceur peut effectuer des attaques d’agrippement comme un ours, en utilisant la Table d’Attaque d’Agrippement avec un maximum de résultats Moyens. Cette attaque nécessite une Compétence développée séparément, comparable aux Arts Martiaux — Balayages/Projections."},"en":{"name":"Bear Arms","description":"Caster can make grapple attacks as a bear, using the Grapple Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Sweeps/Throws."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Glide III","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide III.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide III.description","level":16,"description":"As Glide I, except the product of altitude and horizontal speed can equal 300 feet per round.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Plané III","description":"Comme Plané I, mais le produit de l’altitude et de la vitesse horizontale peut atteindre 300 pieds par round."},"en":{"name":"Glide III","description":"As Glide I, except the product of altitude and horizontal speed can equal 300 feet per round."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Viperfang","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Viperfang.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Viperfang.description","level":17,"description":"Caster can make bite attacks as a serpent, using the Bite Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Striking.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Croc de Vipère","description":"Le lanceur peut effectuer des attaques de morsure comme un serpent, en utilisant la Table d’Attaque de Morsure avec un maximum de résultats Moyens. Cette attaque nécessite une Compétence développée séparément, comparable aux Arts Martiaux — Frappes."},"en":{"name":"Viperfang","description":"Caster can make bite attacks as a serpent, using the Bite Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Striking."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Wyvern Skin","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Wyvern Skin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Wyvern Skin.description","level":18,"description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a minor drake, equivalent to Armor Type 12.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Peau de Vouivre","description":"La peau du lanceur acquiert la résistance d’un drake mineur, équivalente à un Type d’Armure 12."},"en":{"name":"Wyvern Skin","description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a minor drake, equivalent to Armor Type 12."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Deer Speed III","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed III.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed III.description","level":19,"description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to four times normal pace (Fast Sprint pace).","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vitesse du Cerf III","description":"Comme Vitesse du Cerf I, mais la vitesse passe à quatre fois l’allure normale (allure Sprint Rapide)."},"en":{"name":"Deer Speed III","description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to four times normal pace (Fast Sprint pace)."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Ox Strength","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Ox Strength.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Ox Strength.description","level":20,"description":"Caster gains the strength of an ox, receiving +40 melee OB but unable to parry or use missile weapons for the duration.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Force du Bœuf","description":"Le lanceur acquiert la force d’un bœuf et reçoit +40 BO en mêlée, mais ne peut ni parer ni utiliser d’armes de projectile pendant la durée du sort."},"en":{"name":"Ox Strength","description":"Caster gains the strength of an ox, receiving +40 melee OB but unable to parry or use missile weapons for the duration."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Glide True","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide True.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide True.description","level":25,"description":"As Glide I, except the product of altitude and horizontal speed can equal 500 feet per round.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Plané Véritable","description":"Comme Plané I, mais le produit de l’altitude et de la vitesse horizontale peut atteindre 500 pieds par round."},"en":{"name":"Glide True","description":"As Glide I, except the product of altitude and horizontal speed can equal 500 feet per round."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Deer Speed True","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed True.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed True.description","level":30,"description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to five times normal pace (Dash pace).","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vitesse du Cerf Véritable","description":"Comme Vitesse du Cerf I, mais la vitesse passe à cinq fois l’allure normale (allure Course Maximale)."},"en":{"name":"Deer Speed True","description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to five times normal pace (Dash pace)."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Animist","name":"Dragon Skin","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Dragon Skin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Dragon Skin.description","level":50,"description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a lesser drake, equivalent to Armor Type 20.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Peau de Dragon","description":"La peau du lanceur acquiert la résistance d’un drake inférieur, équivalente à un Type d’Armure 20."},"en":{"name":"Dragon Skin","description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a lesser drake, equivalent to Armor Type 20."}}}]},"_id":"Ki4Fex4mBSMsuuh2"}
{"name":"Starlights","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/chevron-elipse-circle-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"astrologer-starlights","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Mentalism Companion","sourceList":"Starlights","sourcePage":129,"merpRealm":"Channeling,Mentalism","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Astrologer","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"Mentalism Companion pp. 129 — Astrologer Base List"},"compendiumSourceKey":"astrologer-starlights","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-hybrid-astrologer","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lumières Stellaires","system":{"name":"Lumières Stellaires","label":"Lumières Stellaires","notesLabel":"Lumières Stellaires — notes","notes":"<h2>Lumières Stellaires</h2><p>Manipulation de la lumière, auras lumineuses et attaques de lumière stellaire.</p><p><strong>Conversion MERP-RMU :</strong> Liste historique de l’Astrologue, structurée au format RMU à partir du <em>Mentalism Companion</em>.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Starlights","system":{"name":"Starlights","label":"Starlights","notesLabel":"Starlights — notes","notes":"<h2>Starlights</h2><p>Manipulation of light, luminous auras, and attacks of starlight.</p><p><strong>MERP-RMU Conversion:</strong> historical Astrologer List, structured in RMU format from the <em>Mentalism Companion</em>.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts Hybrides","Astrologue (Base)"],"en":["Hybrid Spell Lists","Astrologer (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-hybrid","spell-lists-hybrid-astrologer"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / Mentalism Companion","name":"Starlights","listType":"Base","realms":"Channeling,Mentalism","profession":"Astrologer","notes":"<h2>Starlights</h2><p>Manipulation of light, luminous auras, and attacks of starlight.</p><p><strong>MERP-RMU Conversion:</strong> historical Astrologer List, structured in RMU format from the <em>Mentalism Companion</em>.</p>","label":"Starlights","notesLabel":"Starlights — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Projected Light","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.ProjectedLight.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.ProjectedLight.description","level":1,"description":"Projette depuis la paume un faisceau lumineux comparable à une puissante lanterne.","aoe":"50' beam","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lumière Projetée","description":"Projette depuis la paume un faisceau lumineux comparable à une puissante lanterne."},"en":{"name":"Projected Light","description":"Projects from the palm a beam of light comparable to a powerful lantern."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Self Aura I","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.SelfAuraI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.SelfAuraI.description","level":2,"description":"Entoure le lanceur d’une aura lumineuse imposante ; les attaques contre lui subissent une pénalité croissante.","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Aura Personnelle I","description":"Entoure le lanceur d’une aura lumineuse imposante ; les attaques contre lui subissent une pénalité croissante."},"en":{"name":"Self Aura I","description":"Surrounds the caster with an imposing luminous aura; attacks against the caster suffer an increasing penalty."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Light II","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LightII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LightII.description","level":3,"description":"Crée ou intensifie une zone de lumière selon la zone d’effet indiquée.","aoe":"20'R","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"touch","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lumière II","description":"Crée ou intensifie une zone de lumière selon la zone d’effet indiquée."},"en":{"name":"Light II","description":"Creates or intensifies an area of light according to the listed area of effect."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Light Eruption","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LightEruption.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LightEruption.description","level":4,"description":"Crée ou intensifie une zone de lumière selon la zone d’effet indiquée.","aoe":"10'R","duration":"--","range":"100'","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Éruption de Lumière","description":"Crée ou intensifie une zone de lumière selon la zone d’effet indiquée."},"en":{"name":"Light Eruption","description":"Creates or intensifies an area of light according to the listed area of effect."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Shock Bolt I","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.ShockBoltI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.ShockBoltI.description","level":5,"description":"Projette un trait de lumière concentrée résolu comme une attaque élémentaire de lumière.","aoe":"1 target","duration":"--","range":"100'","spellType":"DE","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Trait de Choc I","description":"Projette un trait de lumière concentrée résolu comme une attaque élémentaire de lumière."},"en":{"name":"Shock Bolt I","description":"Projects a bolt of concentrated light resolved as an elemental light attack."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Self Aura II","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.SelfAuraII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.SelfAuraII.description","level":6,"description":"Entoure le lanceur d’une aura lumineuse imposante ; les attaques contre lui subissent une pénalité croissante.","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Aura Personnelle II","description":"Entoure le lanceur d’une aura lumineuse imposante ; les attaques contre lui subissent une pénalité croissante."},"en":{"name":"Self Aura II","description":"Surrounds the caster with an imposing luminous aura; attacks against the caster suffer an increasing penalty."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Flare","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.Flare.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.Flare.description","level":7,"description":"Projette une boule de lumière qui éclate en flare ; peut produire un effet de chaleur sur une cible.","aoe":"varies","duration":"3 rnds","range":"500'","spellType":"DE","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Éclat","description":"Projette une boule de lumière qui éclate en flare ; peut produire un effet de chaleur sur une cible."},"en":{"name":"Flare","description":"Projects a ball of light that bursts in a flare and may produce a heat effect on a target."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Utterlight I","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.UtterlightI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.UtterlightI.description","level":8,"description":"Crée une lumière totale qui dissipe l’obscurité magique dans la zone.","aoe":"10'R","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"touch","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lumière Totale I","description":"Crée une lumière totale qui dissipe l’obscurité magique dans la zone."},"en":{"name":"Utterlight I","description":"Creates total light that dispels magical darkness within the area."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Self Aura III","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.SelfAuraIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.SelfAuraIII.description","level":9,"description":"Entoure le lanceur d’une aura lumineuse imposante ; les attaques contre lui subissent une pénalité croissante.","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Aura Personnelle III","description":"Entoure le lanceur d’une aura lumineuse imposante ; les attaques contre lui subissent une pénalité croissante."},"en":{"name":"Self Aura III","description":"Surrounds the caster with an imposing luminous aura; attacks against the caster suffer an increasing penalty."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Beacon V","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.BeaconV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.BeaconV.description","level":10,"description":"Projette un rayon lumineux extrêmement long servant de balise.","aoe":"5 miles","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Balise V","description":"Projette un rayon lumineux extrêmement long servant de balise."},"en":{"name":"Beacon V","description":"Projects an extremely long beam of light that serves as a beacon."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Light VI","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LightVI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LightVI.description","level":11,"description":"Crée ou intensifie une zone de lumière selon la zone d’effet indiquée.","aoe":"60'R","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"touch","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lumière VI","description":"Crée ou intensifie une zone de lumière selon la zone d’effet indiquée."},"en":{"name":"Light VI","description":"Creates or intensifies an area of light according to the listed area of effect."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Lesser Starbolt","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LesserStarbolt.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LesserStarbolt.description","level":12,"description":"Projette un trait de lumière concentrée résolu comme une attaque élémentaire de lumière.","aoe":"1 target","duration":"--","range":"300'","spellType":"DE","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Trait Stellaire Mineur","description":"Projette un trait de lumière concentrée résolu comme une attaque élémentaire de lumière."},"en":{"name":"Lesser Starbolt","description":"Projects a bolt of concentrated light resolved as an elemental light attack."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Waiting Light II","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.WaitingLightII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.WaitingLightII.description","level":13,"description":"Place un effet de lumière en attente, déclenché par une condition définie.","aoe":"20'R","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"touch","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lumière en Attente II","description":"Place un effet de lumière en attente, déclenché par une condition définie."},"en":{"name":"Waiting Light II","description":"Places a light effect in waiting, triggered by a defined condition."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Lord Self Aura","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LordSelfAura.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LordSelfAura.description","level":14,"description":"Entoure le lanceur d’une aura lumineuse imposante ; les attaques contre lui subissent une pénalité croissante.","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Aura Personnelle Seigneur","description":"Entoure le lanceur d’une aura lumineuse imposante ; les attaques contre lui subissent une pénalité croissante."},"en":{"name":"Lord Self Aura","description":"Surrounds the caster with an imposing luminous aura; attacks against the caster suffer an increasing penalty."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Flash","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.Flash.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.Flash.description","level":15,"description":"Un éclair brillant aveugle brièvement la cible en cas d’échec de résistance.","aoe":"1 target","duration":"--","range":"100'","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Éclair","description":"Un éclair brillant aveugle brièvement la cible en cas d’échec de résistance."},"en":{"name":"Flash","description":"A brilliant flash briefly blinds the target if it fails to resist."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Beacon X","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.BeaconX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.BeaconX.description","level":16,"description":"Projette un rayon lumineux extrêmement long servant de balise.","aoe":"10 miles","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Balise X","description":"Projette un rayon lumineux extrêmement long servant de balise."},"en":{"name":"Beacon X","description":"Projects an extremely long beam of light that serves as a beacon."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Lord Light","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LordLight.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.LordLight.description","level":17,"description":"Effet de niveau 17 de la Liste Starlights, converti depuis Mentalism Companion.","aoe":"200'R","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"touch","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lumière Seigneur","description":"Effet de niveau 17 de la Liste Starlights, converti depuis Mentalism Companion."},"en":{"name":"Lord Light","description":"Level 17 effect from the Starlights List, converted from the Mentalism Companion."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Utterlight V","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.UtterlightV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.UtterlightV.description","level":18,"description":"Crée une lumière totale qui dissipe l’obscurité magique dans la zone.","aoe":"50'R","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"touch","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lumière Totale V","description":"Crée une lumière totale qui dissipe l’obscurité magique dans la zone."},"en":{"name":"Utterlight V","description":"Creates total light that dispels magical darkness within the area."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Greater Starbolt","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.GreaterStarbolt.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.GreaterStarbolt.description","level":19,"description":"Projette un trait de lumière concentrée résolu comme une attaque élémentaire de lumière.","aoe":"1 target","duration":"--","range":"1000'","spellType":"DE","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Trait Stellaire Supérieur","description":"Projette un trait de lumière concentrée résolu comme une attaque élémentaire de lumière."},"en":{"name":"Greater Starbolt","description":"Projects a bolt of concentrated light resolved as an elemental light attack."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Self Aura True","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.SelfAuraTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.SelfAuraTrue.description","level":20,"description":"Entoure le lanceur d’une aura lumineuse imposante ; les attaques contre lui subissent une pénalité croissante.","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Aura Personnelle Véritable","description":"Entoure le lanceur d’une aura lumineuse imposante ; les attaques contre lui subissent une pénalité croissante."},"en":{"name":"Self Aura True","description":"Surrounds the caster with an imposing luminous aura; attacks against the caster suffer an increasing penalty."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Starfires","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.Starfires.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.Starfires.description","level":25,"description":"Concentre lumière stellaire ou lunaire en un foyer ardent capable de brûler progressivement la matière.","aoe":"1 point","duration":"C","range":"500'","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Feux Stellaires","description":"Concentre lumière stellaire ou lunaire en un foyer ardent capable de brûler progressivement la matière."},"en":{"name":"Starfires","description":"Concentrates starlight or moonlight into a burning focus capable of progressively burning matter."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Starhand","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.Starhand.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.Starhand.description","level":30,"description":"Concentre Starfires au voisinage de la main du lanceur pour l’utiliser comme attaque dirigée mobile.","aoe":"1 point","duration":"1 rnd/lvl","range":"6\"","spellType":"DE","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Main Stellaire","description":"Concentre Starfires au voisinage de la main du lanceur pour l’utiliser comme attaque dirigée mobile."},"en":{"name":"Starhand","description":"Concentrates Starfires near the caster’s hand for use as a mobile directed attack."}}},{"spellList":"Starlights","listType":"Base","profession":"Astrologer","name":"Starfires True","label":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.StarfiresTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Astrologer.Starlights.spells.StarfiresTrue.description","level":50,"description":"Concentre lumière stellaire ou lunaire en un foyer ardent capable de brûler progressivement la matière.","aoe":"1 point","duration":"varies","range":"varies","spellType":"DE","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Feux Stellaires Véritables","description":"Concentre lumière stellaire ou lunaire en un foyer ardent capable de brûler progressivement la matière."},"en":{"name":"Starfires True","description":"Concentrates starlight or moonlight into a burning focus capable of progressively burning matter."}}}]},"_id":"3ektZqykfci9Eh17"}
{"name":"Nature's Movement/Senses","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-horned-white-purple.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"drughan-natures-movement-senses","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Spell Law","sourceList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","sourcePage":32,"merpRealm":"Channeling","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Drughân","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"RMSS Spell Law p.32 — Nature’s Movement/Senses; MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5 — Drughân p.151"},"compendiumSourceKey":"drughan-natures-movement-senses","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-channeling-drughan","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Mouvements et Sens de la Nature","system":{"name":"Mouvements et Sens de la Nature","label":"Mouvements et Sens de la Nature","notesLabel":"Mouvements et Sens de la Nature — notes","notes":"<h2>Mouvements et Sens de la Nature</h2><p>Liste de base du Drughân conservée depuis RMSS pour MERP-RMU. Elle améliore les sens, la mobilité, la résistance et certaines capacités physiques du lanceur en empruntant des qualités animales.</p><p><strong>Note :</strong> sauf Peau de Caméléon, Griffes de Lion et Croc de Vipère, les sorts de cette Liste ne modifient pas physiquement l’apparence du lanceur.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Nature's Movement/Senses","system":{"name":"Nature's Movement/Senses","label":"Nature's Movement/Senses","notesLabel":"Nature's Movement/Senses — notes","notes":"<h2>Nature's Movement/Senses</h2><p>Drughân Base List retained from RMSS for MERP-RMU. It enhances the caster's senses, mobility, resistance, and certain physical capabilities by borrowing animal qualities.</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> except for Chameleon Skin, Lion Claws, and Viperfang, spells from this List do not physically alter the caster's appearance.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Théurgie","Drughân (Base)"],"en":["Channeling Spell Lists","Drughan (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-channeling","spell-lists-channeling-drughan"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / RMSS Spell Law","name":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","realms":"Channeling","profession":"Drughân","notes":"<h2>Nature's Movement/Senses</h2><p>Drughân Base List retained from RMSS for MERP-RMU. It enhances the caster's senses, mobility, resistance, and certain physical capabilities by borrowing animal qualities.</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> except for Chameleon Skin, Lion Claws, and Viperfang, spells from this List do not physically alter the caster's appearance.</p>","label":"Nature's Movement/Senses","notesLabel":"Nature's Movement/Senses — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Cat Step","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Cat Step.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Cat Step.description","level":1,"description":"Caster moves as quietly as a cat and gains +20 to all Stalking maneuvers.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pas de Chat","description":"Le lanceur se déplace aussi silencieusement qu’un chat et gagne +20 à toutes les Manœuvres de Filature."},"en":{"name":"Cat Step","description":"Caster moves as quietly as a cat and gains +20 to all Stalking maneuvers."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Chameleon Skin","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Chameleon Skin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Chameleon Skin.description","level":2,"description":"Caster’s skin takes on the coloration of the surrounding terrain, granting +10 to +50 to Stalking/Hiding maneuvers. The coloration changes to match surrounding terrain but does not affect gear or clothing.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Peau de Caméléon","description":"La peau du lanceur adopte la coloration du terrain environnant, conférant de +10 à +50 aux Manœuvres de Filature/Dissimulation. La coloration s’adapte au décor, mais n’affecte ni l’équipement ni les vêtements."},"en":{"name":"Chameleon Skin","description":"Caster’s skin takes on the coloration of the surrounding terrain, granting +10 to +50 to Stalking/Hiding maneuvers. The coloration changes to match surrounding terrain but does not affect gear or clothing."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Wolf Sense","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Wolf Sense.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Wolf Sense.description","level":3,"description":"Caster gains an increased sense of smell and hearing, including subtle smells and higher sonic ranges. This gives +50 to Perception using only these senses and +20 when combined with other senses.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens du Loup","description":"Le lanceur bénéficie d’un odorat et d’une ouïe accrus, notamment pour les odeurs subtiles et les fréquences sonores élevées. Il gagne +50 à la Perception utilisant uniquement ces sens et +20 lorsqu’ils sont combinés à d’autres sens."},"en":{"name":"Wolf Sense","description":"Caster gains an increased sense of smell and hearing, including subtle smells and higher sonic ranges. This gives +50 to Perception using only these senses and +20 when combined with other senses."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Deer Speed I","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed I.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed I.description","level":4,"description":"Caster can run at twice normal pace (Run pace) while expending exhaustion as if only walking.","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vitesse du Cerf I","description":"Le lanceur peut courir à deux fois son allure normale (allure Course) tout en dépensant de l’Endurance comme s’il marchait."},"en":{"name":"Deer Speed I","description":"Caster can run at twice normal pace (Run pace) while expending exhaustion as if only walking."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Bat Sense","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bat Sense.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bat Sense.description","level":5,"description":"Caster can maneuver more effectively without sight. When blinded or otherwise without sight, the spell reduces darkness/blindness maneuver penalties by +10 to +50; it does not remove blindness.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens de la Chauve-souris","description":"Le lanceur peut manœuvrer plus efficacement sans la vue. Lorsqu’il est aveuglé ou privé de vision, le sort réduit de 10 à 50 points les pénalités de Manœuvre dues à l’obscurité ou à la cécité ; il ne supprime pas la cécité."},"en":{"name":"Bat Sense","description":"Caster can maneuver more effectively without sight. When blinded or otherwise without sight, the spell reduces darkness/blindness maneuver penalties by +10 to +50; it does not remove blindness."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Otterlungs","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Otterlungs.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Otterlungs.description","level":6,"description":"Caster can safely hold breath for the duration of the spell.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poumons de Loutre","description":"Le lanceur peut retenir sa respiration sans danger pendant toute la durée du sort."},"en":{"name":"Otterlungs","description":"Caster can safely hold breath for the duration of the spell."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Glide I","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide I.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide I.description","level":7,"description":"Caster can glide like a bird. The product of altitude and horizontal speed cannot exceed 100 feet per round; the caster cannot choose a total less than or greater than 100.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Plané I","description":"Le lanceur peut planer comme un oiseau. Le produit de l’altitude et de la vitesse horizontale ne peut dépasser 100 pieds par round ; le lanceur ne peut choisir un total inférieur ou supérieur à 100."},"en":{"name":"Glide I","description":"Caster can glide like a bird. The product of altitude and horizontal speed cannot exceed 100 feet per round; the caster cannot choose a total less than or greater than 100."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Hawk's Sense","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Hawk's Sense.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Hawk's Sense.description","level":8,"description":"Caster gains the visual acuity of a hawk, granting +50 to Perception involving only sight and +20 when sight is combined with other senses.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens du Faucon","description":"Le lanceur bénéficie de l’acuité visuelle d’un faucon, gagnant +50 à la Perception fondée uniquement sur la vue et +20 lorsque la vue est combinée à d’autres sens."},"en":{"name":"Hawk's Sense","description":"Caster gains the visual acuity of a hawk, granting +50 to Perception involving only sight and +20 when sight is combined with other senses."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Tiger Skin","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Tiger Skin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Tiger Skin.description","level":9,"description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a large cat, equivalent to Armor Type 3.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Peau de Tigre","description":"La peau du lanceur acquiert la résistance d’un grand félin, équivalente à un Type d’Armure 3."},"en":{"name":"Tiger Skin","description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a large cat, equivalent to Armor Type 3."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Boar Strength","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Boar Strength.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Boar Strength.description","level":10,"description":"Caster gains the force of a wild boar, receiving +20 melee OB but unable to parry or use missile weapons for the duration.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Force du Sanglier","description":"Le lanceur acquiert la puissance d’un sanglier sauvage et reçoit +20 BO en mêlée, mais ne peut ni parer ni utiliser d’armes de projectile pendant la durée du sort."},"en":{"name":"Boar Strength","description":"Caster gains the force of a wild boar, receiving +20 melee OB but unable to parry or use missile weapons for the duration."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Lion Claws","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Lion Claws.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Lion Claws.description","level":11,"description":"Caster can make claw attacks as a lion, using the Claw Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Striking.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Griffes de Lion","description":"Le lanceur peut attaquer avec des griffes comme un lion, en utilisant la Table d’Attaque de Griffes avec un maximum de résultats Moyens. Cette attaque nécessite une Compétence développée séparément, comparable aux Arts Martiaux — Frappes."},"en":{"name":"Lion Claws","description":"Caster can make claw attacks as a lion, using the Claw Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Striking."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Insect Sense","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Insect Sense.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Insect Sense.description","level":12,"description":"Caster gains an insect-like sensitivity to vibrations through the ground or other solid material within the area. The spell indicates general movement and approximate number of targets and grants +25 to +100 to appropriate Perception maneuvers depending on activity.","aoe":"10'R/lvl","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens de l’Insecte","description":"Le lanceur acquiert une sensibilité de type insecte aux vibrations transmises par le sol ou un autre matériau solide dans la zone. Le sort indique les mouvements généraux et le nombre approximatif de cibles et confère de +25 à +100 aux Manœuvres de Perception appropriées selon l’activité."},"en":{"name":"Insect Sense","description":"Caster gains an insect-like sensitivity to vibrations through the ground or other solid material within the area. The spell indicates general movement and approximate number of targets and grants +25 to +100 to appropriate Perception maneuvers depending on activity."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Deer Speed II","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed II.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed II.description","level":13,"description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to three times normal pace (Sprint pace).","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vitesse du Cerf II","description":"Comme Vitesse du Cerf I, mais la vitesse passe à trois fois l’allure normale (allure Sprint)."},"en":{"name":"Deer Speed II","description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to three times normal pace (Sprint pace)."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Bear Skin","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bear Skin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bear Skin.description","level":14,"description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a bear, equivalent to Armor Type 8.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Peau d’Ours","description":"La peau du lanceur acquiert la résistance d’un ours, équivalente à un Type d’Armure 8."},"en":{"name":"Bear Skin","description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a bear, equivalent to Armor Type 8."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Bear Arms","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bear Arms.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Bear Arms.description","level":15,"description":"Caster can make grapple attacks as a bear, using the Grapple Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Sweeps/Throws.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Bras d’Ours","description":"Le lanceur peut effectuer des attaques d’agrippement comme un ours, en utilisant la Table d’Attaque d’Agrippement avec un maximum de résultats Moyens. Cette attaque nécessite une Compétence développée séparément, comparable aux Arts Martiaux — Balayages/Projections."},"en":{"name":"Bear Arms","description":"Caster can make grapple attacks as a bear, using the Grapple Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Sweeps/Throws."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Glide III","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide III.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide III.description","level":16,"description":"As Glide I, except the product of altitude and horizontal speed can equal 300 feet per round.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Plané III","description":"Comme Plané I, mais le produit de l’altitude et de la vitesse horizontale peut atteindre 300 pieds par round."},"en":{"name":"Glide III","description":"As Glide I, except the product of altitude and horizontal speed can equal 300 feet per round."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Viperfang","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Viperfang.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Viperfang.description","level":17,"description":"Caster can make bite attacks as a serpent, using the Bite Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Striking.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Croc de Vipère","description":"Le lanceur peut effectuer des attaques de morsure comme un serpent, en utilisant la Table d’Attaque de Morsure avec un maximum de résultats Moyens. Cette attaque nécessite une Compétence développée séparément, comparable aux Arts Martiaux — Frappes."},"en":{"name":"Viperfang","description":"Caster can make bite attacks as a serpent, using the Bite Attack Table with a maximum of Medium results. This attack requires a separately developed skill comparable to Martial Arts Striking."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Wyvern Skin","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Wyvern Skin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Wyvern Skin.description","level":18,"description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a minor drake, equivalent to Armor Type 12.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Peau de Vouivre","description":"La peau du lanceur acquiert la résistance d’un drake mineur, équivalente à un Type d’Armure 12."},"en":{"name":"Wyvern Skin","description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a minor drake, equivalent to Armor Type 12."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Deer Speed III","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed III.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed III.description","level":19,"description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to four times normal pace (Fast Sprint pace).","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vitesse du Cerf III","description":"Comme Vitesse du Cerf I, mais la vitesse passe à quatre fois l’allure normale (allure Sprint Rapide)."},"en":{"name":"Deer Speed III","description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to four times normal pace (Fast Sprint pace)."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Ox Strength","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Ox Strength.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Ox Strength.description","level":20,"description":"Caster gains the strength of an ox, receiving +40 melee OB but unable to parry or use missile weapons for the duration.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Force du Bœuf","description":"Le lanceur acquiert la force d’un bœuf et reçoit +40 BO en mêlée, mais ne peut ni parer ni utiliser d’armes de projectile pendant la durée du sort."},"en":{"name":"Ox Strength","description":"Caster gains the strength of an ox, receiving +40 melee OB but unable to parry or use missile weapons for the duration."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Glide True","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide True.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Glide True.description","level":25,"description":"As Glide I, except the product of altitude and horizontal speed can equal 500 feet per round.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Plané Véritable","description":"Comme Plané I, mais le produit de l’altitude et de la vitesse horizontale peut atteindre 500 pieds par round."},"en":{"name":"Glide True","description":"As Glide I, except the product of altitude and horizontal speed can equal 500 feet per round."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Deer Speed True","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed True.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Deer Speed True.description","level":30,"description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to five times normal pace (Dash pace).","aoe":"caster","duration":"10 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vitesse du Cerf Véritable","description":"Comme Vitesse du Cerf I, mais la vitesse passe à cinq fois l’allure normale (allure Course Maximale)."},"en":{"name":"Deer Speed True","description":"As Deer Speed I, except speed is increased to five times normal pace (Dash pace)."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Movement/Senses","listType":"Base","profession":"Drughân","name":"Dragon Skin","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Dragon Skin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesMovementSenses.spells.Dragon Skin.description","level":50,"description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a lesser drake, equivalent to Armor Type 20.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Peau de Dragon","description":"La peau du lanceur acquiert la résistance d’un drake inférieur, équivalente à un Type d’Armure 20."},"en":{"name":"Dragon Skin","description":"Caster’s skin gains the resilience of a lesser drake, equivalent to Armor Type 20."}}}]},"_id":"P5xCHOHJvzqBI44C"}
