k Mastery</h2><p>Herutano offensive mastery List, centered on improving attacks, weapon handling, and the controlled application of martial power.</p>","label":"Attack Mastery","notesLabel":"Attack Mastery — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Attack Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Lightning Strike","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.LightningStrike.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.LightningStrike.description","level":1,"description":"Allows the caster to make an attack in the current Snap Action phase without the usual -20 penalty; the attack is part of the spell.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 rnd","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Frappe Éclair","description":"Permet au lanceur d’effectuer une attaque pendant la phase d’Action Instantanée en cours sans subir la pénalité habituelle de −20 ; l’attaque fait partie du sort."},"en":{"name":"Lightning Strike","description":"Allows the caster to make an attack in the current Snap Action phase without the usual -20 penalty; the attack is part of the spell."}}},{"spellList":"Attack Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Attack I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.AttackI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.AttackI.description","level":2,"description":"Adds +15 to the caster’s melee or missile attack for the current round.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 attack","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Attaque I","description":"Ajoute +15 à l’attaque de mêlée ou de projectile du lanceur pour le round en cours."},"en":{"name":"Attack I","description":"Adds +15 to the caster’s melee or missile attack for the current round."}}},{"spellList":"Attack Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Draw Weapon","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.DrawWeapon.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.DrawWeapon.description","level":3,"description":"The caster’s weapon leaps into the caster’s hand, negating normal penalties for drawing it.","aoe":"1 weapon","duration":"--","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Dégainer l’Arme","description":"L’arme du lanceur bondit dans sa main, annulant les pénalités normales liées au fait de la dégainer."},"en":{"name":"Draw Weapon","description":"The caster’s weapon leaps into the caster’s hand, negating normal penalties for drawing it."}}},{"spellList":"Attack Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Weapon I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.WeaponI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.WeaponI.description","level":4,"description":"Enchants a weapon with a +5 general magical bonus or +10 against one broad group.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hrs","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Arme I","description":"Enchante une arme en lui conférant un bonus magique général de +5 ou +10 contre un vaste groupe de créatures."},"en":{"name":"Weapon I","description":"Enchants a weapon with a +5 general magical bonus or +10 against one broad group."}}},{"spellList":"Attack Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Split Parry II","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.SplitParryII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.SplitParryII.description","level":5,"description":"Caster may divide parry between up to two melee attackers without the normal split penalty.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 rnd","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Parade Répartie II","description":"Le lanceur peut répartir sa parade entre deux attaquants de mêlée au maximum sans subir la pénalité normale de répartition."},"en":{"name":"Split Parry II","description":"Caster may divide parry between up to two melee attackers without the normal split penalty."}}},{"spellList":"Attack Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Summon Weapon","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.SummonWeapon.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.SummonWeapon.description","level":6,"description":"Summons one weapon within range to the caster’s hand.","aoe":"1 weapon","duration":"--","range":"50'","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Appel de l’Arme","description":"Appelle dans la main du lanceur une arme située à portée."},"en":{"name":"Summon Weapon","description":"Summons one weapon within range to the caster’s hand."}}},{"spellList":"Attack Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Attack III","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.AttackIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.AttackIII.description","level":7,"description":"Improves the caster’s attack bonus according to the progression of Attack spells on this list.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 attack","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Attaque III","description":"Améliore le bonus d’attaque du lanceur selon la progression des sorts d’Attaque de cette liste."},"en":{"name":"Attack III","description":"Improves the caster’s attack bonus according to the progression of Attack spells on this list."}}},{"spellList":"Attack Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Weapon II","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.WeaponII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.WeaponII.description","level":8,"description":"As Weapon I, with a greater enchantment bonus.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hrs","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Arme II","description":"Comme Arme I, mais avec un bonus d’enchantement supérieur."},"en":{"name":"Weapon II","description":"As Weapon I, with a greater enchantment bonus."}}},{"spellList":"Attack Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Split Attack II","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.SplitAttackII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.SplitAttackII.description","level":9,"description":"Allows the caster to divide an attack between up to two valid targets as defined by the source list.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 rnd","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Attaque Répartie II","description":"Permet au lanceur de répartir une attaque entre deux cibles valides au maximum, conformément aux règles de la liste d’origine."},"en":{"name":"Split Attack II","description":"Allows the caster to divide an attack between up to two valid targets as defined by the source list."}}},{"spellList":"Attack Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Attack IV","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.AttackIV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.AttackIV.description","level":10,"description":"Improves the caster’s melee or missile attack for one attack.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 attack","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Attaque IV","description":"Améliore l’attaque de mêlée ou de projectile du lanceur pour une attaque."},"en":{"name":"Attack IV","description":"Improves the caster’s melee or missile attack for one attack."}}},{"spellList":"Attack Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Split Parry III","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.SplitParryIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.weaponsmith.spells.SplitParryIII.description","level":11,"description":"As Split Parry II, but may divide parry among up to three melee attackers.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 rnd","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Parade Répartie III","description":"Comme Parade Répartie II, mais la parade peut être répartie entre trois attaquants de mêlée au maximum."},"en":{"name":"Split Parry III","description":"As Split Parry II, but may divide parry among up to three melee at