d cloth protection."}}},{"spellList":"Defense Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Armour IV","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ArmourIV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ArmourIV.description","level":30,"description":"As Armour I, but grants +20 general or +25 against one broad group.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hrs","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Armure IV","description":"Comme Armure I, mais confère +20 en général ou +25 contre un vaste groupe de créatures."},"en":{"name":"Armour IV","description":"As Armour I, but grants +20 general or +25 against one broad group."}}},{"spellList":"Defense Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Mystical Armour","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.MysticalArmour.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.MysticalArmour.description","level":50,"description":"Creates the list’s ultimate magical armour protection for the caster.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Armure Mystique","description":"Crée pour le lanceur la protection d’armure magique ultime de cette liste."},"en":{"name":"Mystical Armour","description":"Creates the list’s ultimate magical armour protection for the caster."}}}]},"_id":"mxNWLjjDWKPPAhm8"}
{"name":"Elven Inorganic Skills","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/circled-gem-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herutano-elven-inorganic-skills","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Alchemy Companion","sourceList":"Inorganic Skills","sourcePage":84,"merpRealm":"Essence","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Alchemist","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"merp-rmu-adapted-spell-list","reference":"Inorganic Skills -> Elven Inorganic Skills","merpMapping":"Inorganic Skills mechanics adapted to MERP Herutano Elven Inorganic Skills"},"compendiumSourceKey":"herutano-elven-inorganic-skills","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-mentalism-herutano","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Techniques Inorganiques Elfiques","system":{"name":"Techniques Inorganiques Elfiques","label":"Techniques Inorganiques Elfiques","notesLabel":"Techniques Inorganiques Elfiques — notes","notes":"<h2>Techniques Inorganiques Elfiques</h2><p>Travaille pierre, métaux, alliages, gemmes et matériaux magiques. Les noms de matériaux historiques de Rolemaster sont conservés comme références techniques ; leur disponibilité en Terre du Milieu dépend du cadre de campagne et du MJ.</p><p>Les sorts ne créent pas les outils ni les matières premières nécessaires.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Elven Inorganic Skills","system":{"name":"Elven Inorganic Skills","label":"Elven Inorganic Skills","notesLabel":"Elven Inorganic Skills — notes","notes":"<h2>Elven Inorganic Skills</h2><p>Works stone, metals, alloys, gems, and magical materials according to Elven traditions. Historical Rolemaster material names are retained as technical references; their availability in Middle-earth depends on the campaign setting and the GM.</p><p>The spells do not create the tools or raw materials required.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Mentalisme","Herutano (Base)"],"en":["Mentalism Spell Lists","Herutano (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-mentalism","spell-lists-mentalism-herutano"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / Alchemy Companion","name":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","realms":"Mentalism","profession":"Herutano","notes":"<h2>Elven Inorganic Skills</h2><p>Works stone, metals, alloys, gems, and magical materials according to Elven traditions. Historical Rolemaster material names are retained as technical references; their availability in Middle-earth depends on the campaign setting and the GM.</p><p>The spells do not create the tools or raw materials required.</p>","label":"Elven Inorganic Skills","notesLabel":"Elven Inorganic Skills — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Stone","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkStone.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkStone.description","level":1,"description":"Flawlessly works non-magical stone; alternatively grants +50 to Stone Crafts and Sculpting rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de la Pierre","description":"Travaille parfaitement la pierre non magique ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets d’Artisanat de la pierre et de Sculpture."},"en":{"name":"Work Stone","description":"Flawlessly works non-magical stone; alternatively grants +50 to Stone Crafts and Sculpting rolls."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Base Metals","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBaseMetals.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBaseMetals.description","level":2,"description":"Works ordinary base metals such as copper, tin or lead and may extract and forge them with proper equipment.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Métaux de Base","description":"Travaille les métaux de base ordinaires comme le cuivre, l’étain ou le plomb et permet de les extraire et de les forger avec l’équipement approprié."},"en":{"name":"Work Base Metals","description":"Works ordinary base metals such as copper, tin or lead and may extract and forge them with proper equipment."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Base Alloys","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBaseAlloys.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBaseAlloys.description","level":3,"description":"Works ordinary non-iron alloys such as brass, bronze and pewter with proper equipment.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Alliages de Base","description":"Travaille les alliages ordinaires sans fer comme le laiton, le bronze et l’étain avec l’équipement approprié."},"en":{"name":"Work Base Alloys","description":"Works ordinary non-iron alloys such as brass, bronze and pewter with proper equipment."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Iron","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkIron.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkIron.description","level":4,"description":"Works and forges ordinary iron; may create items of normal quality with proper equipment.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Fer","description":"Travaille et forge le fer ordinaire ; permet de créer des objets de qualité normale avec l’équipement approprié."},"en":{"name":"Work Iron","description":"Works and forges ordinary iron; may create items of normal quality with proper equipment."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Low Steel","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkLowSteel.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkLowSteel.description","level":5,"description":"Works low-carbon steel and comparable ordinary alloys, permitting items with modest superior bonuses.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Acier Doux","description":"Travaille l’acier à faible teneur en carbone et les alliages ordinaires comparables, permettant de produire des objets bénéficiant de modestes bonus supérieurs."},"en":{"name":"Work Low Steel","description":"Works low-carbon steel and comparable ordinary alloys, permitting items with modest superior bonuses."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work High Steel","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkHighSteel.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkHighSteel.description","level":6,"description":"Works high-carbon steel and comparable superior ordinary alloys.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Acier Dur","description":"Travaille l’acier à forte teneur en carbone et les alliages ordinaires supérieurs comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work High Steel","description":"Works high-carbon steel and comparable superior ordinary alloys."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Keron","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkKeron.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkKeron.description","level":7,"description":"Works magical alloys such as Keron when the necessary ingredients, tools and knowledge are available.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Keron","description":"Travaille les alliages magiques comme le Keron lorsque les ingrédients, outils et connaissances nécessaires sont disponibles."},"en":{"name":"Work Keron","description":"Works magical alloys such as Keron when the necessary ingredients, tools and knowledge are available."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Precious Metals","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkPreciousMetals.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkPreciousMetals.description","level":8,"description":"Works precious metals such as silver and gold and alloys made from them.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Métaux Précieux","description":"Travaille les métaux précieux comme l’argent et l’or ainsi que les alliages qui en sont issus."},"en":{"name":"Work Precious Metals","description":"Works precious metals such as silver and gold and alloys made from them."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work White Steel","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkWhiteSteel.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkWhiteSteel.description","level":9,"description":"Works superior white-steel alloys and comparable non-magical alloys.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Acier Blanc","description":"Travaille les alliages supérieurs d’acier blanc et les alliages non magiques comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work White Steel","description":"Works superior white-steel alloys and comparable non-magical alloys."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Mithin","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithin.description","level":10,"description":"Works Mithin (beryllium) and comparable high-quality non-magical metals.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Mithin","description":"Travaille le Mithin (béryllium) et les métaux non magiques de haute qualité comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work Mithin","description":"Works Mithin (beryllium) and comparable high-quality non-magical metals."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Gemstone","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkGemstone.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkGemstone.description","level":11,"description":"Cuts, facets and polishes non-magical gemstones; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate gem-cutting or jeweler rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Gemmes","description":"Taille, facette et polit les gemmes non magiques ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets appropriés de taille de gemmes ou de Joaillerie."},"en":{"name":"Work Gemstone","description":"Cuts, facets and polishes non-magical gemstones; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate gem-cutting or jeweler rolls."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Black Steel","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBlackSteel.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkBlackSteel.description","level":12,"description":"Works black-steel alloys and comparable superior non-magical alloys.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Acier Noir","description":"Travaille les alliages d’acier noir et les alliages non magiques supérieurs comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work Black Steel","description":"Works black-steel alloys and comparable superior non-magical alloys."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Mithglin","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithglin.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithglin.description","level":13,"description":"Works Mithglin (titanium) and comparable superior non-magical metals.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Mithglin","description":"Travaille le Mithglin (titane) et les métaux non magiques supérieurs comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work Mithglin","description":"Works Mithglin (titanium) and comparable superior non-magical metals."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Ithilnaur","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkIthilnaur.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkIthilnaur.description","level":14,"description":"Works magical Ithilnaur (moon-fire) and comparable magical alloys.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Ithilnaur","description":"Travaille l’Ithilnaur magique (feu-de-lune) et les alliages magiques comparables."},"en":{"name":"Work Ithilnaur","description":"Works magical Ithilnaur (moon-fire) and comparable magical alloys."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Mithril","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithril.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkMithril.description","level":15,"description":"Works magical Mithril (True-silver) when proper tools, material and facilities are available.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Mithril","description":"Travaille le Mithril magique (Vrai-Argent) lorsque les outils, matériaux et installations appropriés sont disponibles."},"en":{"name":"Work Mithril","description":"Works magical Mithril (True-silver) when proper tools, material and facilities are available."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Laen","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkLaen.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkLaen.description","level":20,"description":"Works magical Laen and other materials of comparable potency.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Laen","description":"Travaille le Laen magique et les autres matériaux d’une puissance comparable."},"en":{"name":"Work Laen","description":"Works magical Laen and other materials of comparable potency."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Eog","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkEog.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkEog.description","level":25,"description":"Works magical Eog and alloys of comparable potency.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Eog","description":"Travaille l’Eog magique et les alliages d’une puissance comparable."},"en":{"name":"Work Eog","description":"Works magical Eog and alloys of comparable potency."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Galvorn","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkGalvorn.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkGalvorn.description","level":30,"description":"Works magical Galvorn and materials of comparable potency.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Galvorn","description":"Travaille le Galvorn magique et les matériaux d’une puissance comparable."},"en":{"name":"Work Galvorn","description":"Works magical Galvorn and materials of comparable potency."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Angil","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkAngil.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkAngil.description","level":35,"description":"Works magical Angil (star-iron) and materials of comparable potency.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail de l’Angil","description":"Travaille l’Angil magique (fer-étoile) et les matériaux d’une puissance comparable."},"en":{"name":"Work Angil","description":"Works magical Angil (star-iron) and materials of comparable potency."}}},{"spellList":"Elven Inorganic Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work True","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.InorganicSkills.spells.WorkTrue.description","level":50,"description":"May make and work any metal, alloy or inorganic mineral, including materials with exceptional anti-magical properties, subject to tools and materials.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail Véritable","description":"Permet de fabriquer et de travailler n’importe quel métal, alliage ou minéral inorganique, y compris les matériaux possédant des propriétés anti-magiques exceptionnelles, sous réserve de disposer des outils et matériaux nécessaires."},"en":{"name":"Work True","description":"May make and work any metal, alloy or inorganic mineral, including materials with exceptional anti-magical properties, subject to tools and materials."}}}]},"_id":"EToBm4TNtZZ5BXSj"}
{"name":"External Concentrations","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/circled-gem-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herutano-external-concentrations","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Alchemy Companion","sourceList":"Organic Skills","sourcePage":83,"merpRealm":"Essence","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Alchemist","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"merp-rmu-adapted-spell-list","reference":"Organic Skills -> External Concentrations","merpMapping":"Organic Skills mechanics adapted to MERP Herutano External Concentrations"},"compendiumSourceKey":"herutano-external-concentrations","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-mentalism-herutano","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Concentrations Externes","system":{"name":"Concentrations Externes","label":"Concentrations Externes","notesLabel":"Concentrations Externes — notes","notes":"<h2>Concentrations Externes</h2><p>Travaille tissus, cuir, bois et autres matières organiques et crée les supports physiques nécessaires à de nombreux objets alchimiques. Le papier runique est réutilisable après déclenchement, mais ne peut porter qu’un seul sort à la fois.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"External Concentrations","system":{"name":"External Concentrations","label":"External Concentrations","notesLabel":"External Concentrations — notes","notes":"<h2>External Concentrations</h2><p>Herutano List devoted to externalized concentration techniques and the controlled application of mental focus to objects and actions outside the caster.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Mentalisme","Herutano (Base)"],"en":["Mentalism Spell Lists","Herutano (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-mentalism","spell-lists-mentalism-herutano"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / Alchemy Companion","name":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","realms":"Mentalism","profession":"Herutano","notes":"<h2>External Concentrations</h2><p>Herutano List devoted to externalized concentration techniques and the controlled application of mental focus to objects and actions outside the caster.</p>","label":"External Concentrations","notesLabel":"External Concentrations — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Cloth","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkCloth.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkCloth.description","level":1,"description":"Flawlessly fabricates and works non-magical cloth when the required tools and materials are available; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate textile Crafting rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Tissu","description":"Fabrique et travaille parfaitement un tissu non magique lorsque les outils et matériaux requis sont disponibles ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets d’Artisanat textile appropriés."},"en":{"name":"Work Cloth","description":"Flawlessly fabricates and works non-magical cloth when the required tools and materials are available; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate textile Crafting rolls."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Leather","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkLeather.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkLeather.description","level":2,"description":"Creates and works non-magical leather, parchment and vellum; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate leatherworking Crafting rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Cuir","description":"Crée et travaille parfaitement le cuir, le parchemin et le vélin non magiques ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets d’Artisanat du cuir appropriés."},"en":{"name":"Work Leather","description":"Creates and works non-magical leather, parchment and vellum; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate leatherworking Crafting rolls."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Wood","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkWood.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkWood.description","level":3,"description":"Flawlessly works non-magical wood; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate woodworking Crafting rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Bois","description":"Travaille parfaitement le bois non magique ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets d’Artisanat du bois appropriés."},"en":{"name":"Work Wood","description":"Flawlessly works non-magical wood; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate woodworking Crafting rolls."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Rune Paper I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperI.description","level":4,"description":"Creates reusable rune paper able to hold one 1st-level spell; also permits flawless paper making and related crafts.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique I","description":"Crée un papier runique réutilisable pouvant contenir un sort de niveau 1 ; permet également de fabriquer parfaitement le papier et d’effectuer des travaux apparentés."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper I","description":"Creates reusable rune paper able to hold one 1st-level spell; also permits flawless paper making and related crafts."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Organic","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkOrganic.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkOrganic.description","level":5,"description":"As Work Cloth, but may work any ordinary non-magical organic material such as horn, bone, chitin, wax, feathers or hair.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail Organique","description":"Comme Travail du Tissu, mais permet de travailler toute matière organique ordinaire non magique, comme la corne, l’os, la chitine, la cire, les plumes ou les cheveux."},"en":{"name":"Work Organic","description":"As Work Cloth, but may work any ordinary non-magical organic material such as horn, bone, chitin, wax, feathers or hair."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Rune Paper II","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperII.description","level":6,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 2nd level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique II","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 2."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper II","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 2nd level."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Make Wand","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeWand.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeWand.description","level":7,"description":"Creates a wand suitable for receiving imbedded spells.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Fabriquer une Baguette","description":"Crée une baguette adaptée à recevoir des sorts imprégnés."},"en":{"name":"Make Wand","description":"Creates a wand suitable for receiving imbedded spells."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Rune Paper III","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperIII.description","level":8,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 3rd level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique III","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 3."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper III","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 3rd level."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Make Rod","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeRod.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeRod.description","level":10,"description":"Creates a rod suitable for receiving imbedded spells.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Fabriquer un Sceptre","description":"Crée un sceptre adapté à recevoir des sorts imprégnés."},"en":{"name":"Make Rod","description":"Creates a rod suitable for receiving imbedded spells."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Rune Paper V","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperV.description","level":11,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 5th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique V","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 5."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper V","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 5th level."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Organic Rune","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.OrganicRune.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.OrganicRune.description","level":13,"description":"When cast immediately before a Rune Paper spell, allows the rune to be placed on a non-living organic material instead of paper.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Rune Organique","description":"Lancé immédiatement avant un sort de Papier Runique, permet de placer la rune sur une matière organique non vivante plutôt que sur du papier."},"en":{"name":"Organic Rune","description":"When cast immediately before a Rune Paper spell, allows the rune to be placed on a non-living organic material instead of paper."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Rune Paper VII","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperVII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperVII.description","level":14,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 7th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique VII","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 7."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper VII","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 7th level."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Make Staff","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeStaff.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.MakeStaff.description","level":15,"description":"Creates a staff suitable for receiving imbedded spells.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Fabriquer un Bâton","description":"Crée un bâton adapté à recevoir des sorts imprégnés."},"en":{"name":"Make Staff","description":"Creates a staff suitable for receiving imbedded spells."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Rune Paper X","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperX.description","level":16,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 10th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique X","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 10."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper X","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 10th level."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Magic Cloth","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicCloth.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicCloth.description","level":17,"description":"As Work Cloth, but may create or work magical cloth.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Tissu Magique","description":"Comme Travail du Tissu, mais permet de créer ou de travailler du tissu magique."},"en":{"name":"Work Magic Cloth","description":"As Work Cloth, but may create or work magical cloth."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Magic Leather","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicLeather.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicLeather.description","level":18,"description":"As Work Leather, but may create or work magical leather.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Cuir Magique","description":"Comme Travail du Cuir, mais permet de créer ou de travailler du cuir magique."},"en":{"name":"Work Magic Leather","description":"As Work Leather, but may create or work magical leather."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Magic Wood","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicWood.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkMagicWood.description","level":19,"description":"As Work Wood, but may create or work magical wood.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail du Bois Magique","description":"Comme Travail du Bois, mais permet de créer ou de travailler du bois magique."},"en":{"name":"Work Magic Wood","description":"As Work Wood, but may create or work magical wood."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Organic True","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkOrganicTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.WorkOrganicTrue.description","level":20,"description":"May create or work extraordinary or magical organic materials, such as dragon hide, when proper tools and materials are available.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail Organique Véritable","description":"Permet de créer ou de travailler des matières organiques extraordinaires ou magiques, comme la peau de dragon, lorsque les outils et matériaux appropriés sont disponibles."},"en":{"name":"Work Organic True","description":"May create or work extraordinary or magical organic materials, such as dragon hide, when proper tools and materials are available."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Lord Rune Paper","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.LordRunePaper.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.LordRunePaper.description","level":25,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 20th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique Seigneur","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 20."},"en":{"name":"Lord Rune Paper","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 20th level."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Rune Paper XXX","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperXXX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperXXX.description","level":30,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 30th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique XXX","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 30."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper XXX","description":"As Rune Paper I, but holds a spell through 30th level."}}},{"spellList":"External Concentrations","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Rune Paper True","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.OrganicSkills.spells.RunePaperTrue.description","level":50,"description":"As Rune Paper I, but may hold a spell of any level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Papier Runique Véritable","description":"Comme Papier Runique I, mais peut contenir un sort de n’importe quel niveau."},"en":{"name":"Rune Paper True","description":"As Rune Paper I, but may hold a spell of any level."}}}]},"_id":"MT9vHUUV596fPrLY"}
{"name":"Liquid/Gas Skills","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/circled-gem-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herutano-liquid-gas-skills","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Alchemy Companion","sourceList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","sourcePage":85,"merpRealm":"Essence","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Alchemist","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"merp-rmu-adapted-spell-list","reference":"Liquid/Gas Skills -> Liquid/Gas Skills","merpMapping":"Direct MERP/RMSS Herutano list using existing Liquid/Gas Skills mechanics"},"compendiumSourceKey":"herutano-liquid-gas-skills","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-mentalism-herutano","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Techniques des Liquides et Gaz","system":{"name":"Techniques des Liquides et Gaz","label":"Techniques des Liquides et Gaz","notesLabel":"Techniques des Liquides et Gaz — notes","notes":"<h2>Techniques des Liquides et Gaz</h2><p>Prépare liquides, gaz, poisons et potions et permet d’y intégrer des sorts grâce aux Listes d’Imbedding. Plusieurs sorts couvrent des domaines voisins ; les bonus alternatifs aux Compétences ne doivent pas être cumulés.</p><p>Les sorts source de niveau 100 et 120 ne sont pas inclus dans cette première conversion RMU.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Liquid/Gas Skills","system":{"name":"Liquid/Gas Skills","label":"Liquid/Gas Skills","notesLabel":"Liquid/Gas Skills — notes","notes":"<h2>Liquid/Gas Skills</h2><p>Prepares liquids, gases, poisons, and potions and allows spells to be incorporated into them through the Imbedding Lists. Several spells cover related fields; alternative Skill bonuses must not be cumulative.</p><p>Source spells of levels 100 and 120 are not included in this first RMU conversion.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Mentalisme","Herutano (Base)"],"en":["Mentalism Spell Lists","Herutano (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-mentalism","spell-lists-mentalism-herutano"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / Alchemy Companion","name":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","realms":"Mentalism","profession":"Herutano","notes":"<h2>Liquid/Gas Skills</h2><p>Prepares liquids, gases, poisons, and potions and allows spells to be incorporated into them through the Imbedding Lists. Several spells cover related fields; alternative Skill bonuses must not be cumulative.</p><p>Source spells of levels 100 and 120 are not included in this first RMU conversion.</p>","label":"Liquid/Gas Skills","notesLabel":"Liquid/Gas Skills — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Liquid","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkLiquid.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkLiquid.description","level":1,"description":"Flawlessly works non-magical liquids; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Alchemy, brewing, distilling or winery rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Liquides","description":"Travaille parfaitement les liquides non magiques ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets appropriés d’Alchimie, de Brassage, de Distillation ou de Vinification."},"en":{"name":"Work Liquid","description":"Flawlessly works non-magical liquids; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Alchemy, brewing, distilling or winery rolls."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Poison I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonI.description","level":2,"description":"Safely handles, prepares and processes poisons with attacks up to 1st level; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate poison skills.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poison I","description":"Manipule, prépare et traite sans danger les poisons dont l’attaque ne dépasse pas le niveau 1 ; peut également conférer +50 aux Compétences appropriées liées aux poisons."},"en":{"name":"Poison I","description":"Safely handles, prepares and processes poisons with attacks up to 1st level; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate poison skills."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Potion I","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionI.description","level":3,"description":"Creates one dose of potion capable of holding one imbedded 1st-level spell.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion I","description":"Crée une dose de potion pouvant contenir un sort imprégné de niveau 1."},"en":{"name":"Potion I","description":"Creates one dose of potion capable of holding one imbedded 1st-level spell."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Poison III","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonIII.description","level":4,"description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 3rd level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poison III","description":"Comme Poison I, mais permet de traiter des poisons jusqu’au niveau 3."},"en":{"name":"Poison III","description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 3rd level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Gas","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkGas.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkGas.description","level":5,"description":"Flawlessly works non-magical gases; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Alchemy rolls.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Gaz","description":"Travaille parfaitement les gaz non magiques ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets d’Alchimie appropriés."},"en":{"name":"Work Gas","description":"Flawlessly works non-magical gases; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Alchemy rolls."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Potion II","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionII.description","level":6,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 2nd level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion II","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 2."},"en":{"name":"Potion II","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 2nd level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Poison VI","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonVI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonVI.description","level":7,"description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 6th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poison VI","description":"Comme Poison I, mais permet de traiter des poisons jusqu’au niveau 6."},"en":{"name":"Poison VI","description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 6th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Potion III","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionIII.description","level":9,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 3rd level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion III","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 3."},"en":{"name":"Potion III","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 3rd level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Poison X","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonX.description","level":10,"description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 10th level.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poison X","description":"Comme Poison I, mais permet de traiter des poisons jusqu’au niveau 10."},"en":{"name":"Poison X","description":"As Poison I, but handles poisons through 10th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Magical Liquid","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkMagicalLiquid.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkMagicalLiquid.description","level":11,"description":"As Work Liquid, but works magical liquids and may attempt to combine multiple magical effects, subject to magic-interaction rules.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Liquides Magiques","description":"Comme Travail des Liquides, mais permet de travailler les liquides magiques et de tenter de combiner plusieurs effets magiques, sous réserve des règles d’interaction magique."},"en":{"name":"Work Magical Liquid","description":"As Work Liquid, but works magical liquids and may attempt to combine multiple magical effects, subject to magic-interaction rules."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Potion IV","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionIV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionIV.description","level":12,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 4th level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion IV","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 4."},"en":{"name":"Potion IV","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 4th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Gaseous Potion","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.GaseousPotion.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.GaseousPotion.description","level":13,"description":"When cast immediately before a Potion spell, creates a gaseous potion released into the air; beings in the affected area may receive an RR as determined by the source rules.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion Gazeuse","description":"Lancé immédiatement avant un sort de Potion, crée une potion gazeuse libérée dans l’air ; les êtres présents dans la zone affectée peuvent bénéficier d’un JR selon les règles d’origine."},"en":{"name":"Gaseous Potion","description":"When cast immediately before a Potion spell, creates a gaseous potion released into the air; beings in the affected area may receive an RR as determined by the source rules."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Work Magical Gas","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkMagicalGas.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.WorkMagicalGas.description","level":14,"description":"As Work Gas, but works magical gases and may attempt to combine multiple magical effects.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Travail des Gaz Magiques","description":"Comme Travail des Gaz, mais permet de travailler les gaz magiques et de tenter de combiner plusieurs effets magiques."},"en":{"name":"Work Magical Gas","description":"As Work Gas, but works magical gases and may attempt to combine multiple magical effects."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Potion V","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionV.description","level":15,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 5th level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion V","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 5."},"en":{"name":"Potion V","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 5th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Potion VII","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionVII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionVII.description","level":20,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 7th level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion VII","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 7."},"en":{"name":"Potion VII","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 7th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Potion X","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionX.description","level":25,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 10th level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion X","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 10."},"en":{"name":"Potion X","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 10th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Multiple Doses","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.MultipleDoses.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.MultipleDoses.description","level":30,"description":"Allows a Potion spell to create several doses by dividing the available spell-level capacity among them.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Doses Multiples","description":"Permet à un sort de Potion de créer plusieurs doses en répartissant entre elles la capacité disponible en niveaux de sort."},"en":{"name":"Multiple Doses","description":"Allows a Potion spell to create several doses by dividing the available spell-level capacity among them."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Poisons True","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonsTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PoisonsTrue.description","level":40,"description":"Safely works poisons of any level or magical nature.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Poisons Véritables","description":"Permet de travailler sans danger des poisons de n’importe quel niveau ou de nature magique."},"en":{"name":"Poisons True","description":"Safely works poisons of any level or magical nature."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Lord Potion","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.LordPotion.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.LordPotion.description","level":50,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 20th level.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion Seigneur","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 20."},"en":{"name":"Lord Potion","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 20th level."}}},{"spellList":"Liquid/Gas Skills","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Potion XXX","label":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionXXX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.Alchemist.LiquidGasSkills.spells.PotionXXX.description","level":75,"description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 30th level. This is optional artifact-scale magic requiring exceptional circumstances.","aoe":"1 dose","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Potion XXX","description":"Comme Potion I, mais peut contenir un sort jusqu’au niveau 30. Il s’agit d’une magie optionnelle de niveau artefact exigeant des circonstances exceptionnelles."},"en":{"name":"Potion XXX","description":"As Potion I, but may hold a spell through 30th level. This is optional artifact-scale magic requiring exceptional circumstances."}}}]},"_id":"dZHaOfunC0aTvJlR"}
{"name":"Other Realm Imbedding","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/circled-gem-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herutano-other-realm-imbedding","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS/MERP","sourceBook":"Alchemy Companion","sourceList":"Other Realm Imbedding","sourcePage":121,"merpRealm":"Channeling","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Razak-zinul","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"merp-rmu-adapted-spell-list","reference":"Other Realm Imbedding -> Other Realm Imbedding","merpMapping":"Direct MERP/RMSS Herutano list using existing Imbedding mechanics"},"compendiumSourceKey":"herutano-other-realm-imbedding","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-mentalism-herutano","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation d'un Autre Royaume","system":{"name":"Imprégnation d'un Autre Royaume","label":"Imprégnation d'un Autre Royaume","notesLabel":"Imprégnation d'un Autre Royaume — notes","notes":"<h2>Imprégnation d'un Autre Royaume</h2><p>Liste d’imprégnation du Razak-Zinul adaptée depuis les listes d’Alchimiste du <em>Alchemy Companion</em>. Elle est convertie au Royaume de Canalisation et utilise les inscriptions/runes khazâdes comme clef d’activation.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Other Realm Imbedding","system":{"name":"Other Realm Imbedding","label":"Other Realm Imbedding","notesLabel":"Other Realm Imbedding — notes","notes":"<h2>Other Realm Imbedding</h2><p>Herutano Imbedding List adapted from the <em>Alchemist</em> traditions. It allows magic from another Realm to be bound according to the specific access and preparation rules of the conversion.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Mentalisme","Herutano (Base)"],"en":["Mentalism Spell Lists","Herutano (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-mentalism","spell-lists-mentalism-herutano"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / Alchemy Companion","name":"Other Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","realms":"Mentalism","profession":"Herutano","notes":"<h2>Other Realm Imbedding</h2><p>Herutano Imbedding List adapted from the <em>Alchemist</em> traditions. It allows magic from another Realm to be bound according to the specific access and preparation rules of the conversion.</p>","label":"Other Realm Imbedding","notesLabel":"Other Realm Imbedding — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Other Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Research","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.Research.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.Research.description","level":1,"description":"Researches special imbedding spells for item creation; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Spell Research and/or Item Creation rolls concerning Mentalism or Essence imbedding.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Recherche","description":"Recherche des sorts d’imprégnation spéciaux destinés à la création d’objets ; peut également conférer +50 aux jets appropriés de Recherche de Sorts et/ou de Création d’Objets concernant l’imprégnation du Mentalisme ou de l’Essence."},"en":{"name":"Research","description":"Researches special imbedding spells for item creation; alternatively grants +50 to appropriate Spell Research and/or Item Creation rolls concerning Mentalism or Essence imbedding."}}},{"spellList":"Other Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Imbed I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedI.description","level":3,"description":"Imbeds one 1st-level Mentalism or Essence spell in an item or potion. The caster must have access to the spell being imbedded.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation I","description":"Imprègne dans un objet ou une potion un sort de Mentalisme ou d’Essence de niveau 1. Le lanceur doit avoir accès au sort à imprégner."},"en":{"name":"Imbed I","description":"Imbeds one 1st-level Mentalism or Essence spell in an item or potion. The caster must have access to the spell being imbedded."}}},{"spellList":"Other Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Charge Wand","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.ChargeWand.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.ChargeWand.description","level":5,"description":"Charges a Mentalism or Essence wand when the caster has access to the appropriate spell.","aoe":"1 wand","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Charger une Baguette","description":"Charge une baguette de Mentalisme ou d’Essence lorsque le lanceur a accès au sort approprié."},"en":{"name":"Charge Wand","description":"Charges a Mentalism or Essence wand when the caster has access to the appropriate spell."}}},{"spellList":"Other Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Imbed II","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedII.description","level":6,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 2nd level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation II","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts jusqu’au niveau 2."},"en":{"name":"Imbed II","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 2nd level."}}},{"spellList":"Other Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Daily I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.DailyI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.DailyI.description","level":7,"description":"An imbedded 1st-level spell may be used once per day.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien I","description":"Un sort imprégné de niveau 1 peut être utilisé une fois par jour."},"en":{"name":"Daily I","description":"An imbedded 1st-level spell may be used once per day."}}},{"spellList":"Other Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Imbed III","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedIII.description","level":9,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 3rd level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation III","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts jusqu’au niveau 3."},"en":{"name":"Imbed III","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed spells through 3rd level."}}},{"spellList":"Other Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Charge Rod","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.ChargeRod.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.ChargeRod.description","level":10,"description":"As Charge Wand, but charges a rod.","aoe":"1 rod","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Charger un Sceptre","description":"Comme Charger une Baguette, mais charge un sceptre."},"en":{"name":"Charge Rod","description":"As Charge Wand, but charges a rod."}}},{"spellList":"Other Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Daily III","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.DailyIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.otherrealmimbedding.spells.DailyIII.description","level":11,"description":"Creates a daily item us