,"description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts de Théurgie jusqu’au niveau 7."},"en":{"name":"Imbed VII","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Channeling spells through 7th level."}}},{"spellList":"Own Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Imbed X","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedX.description","level":20,"description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Channeling spells through 10th level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation X","description":"Comme Imprégnation I, mais permet d’imprégner des sorts de Théurgie jusqu’au niveau 10."},"en":{"name":"Imbed X","description":"As Imbed I, but may imbed Channeling spells through 10th level."}}},{"spellList":"Own Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Daily X","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.DailyX.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.DailyX.description","level":25,"description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 10th level, with daily uses determined by spell level.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien X","description":"Crée un objet à usage quotidien utilisant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 10, le nombre d’utilisations quotidiennes dépendant du niveau du sort."},"en":{"name":"Daily X","description":"Creates a daily item using spells through 10th level, with daily uses determined by spell level."}}},{"spellList":"Own Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Constant","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.Constant.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.Constant.description","level":30,"description":"As Daily X, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Constant","description":"Comme Quotidien X, mais les effets imprégnés appropriés peuvent fonctionner en permanence, sous réserve de l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Constant","description":"As Daily X, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval."}}},{"spellList":"Own Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Imbed True","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedTrue.description","level":50,"description":"Imbeds one Channeling spell of any level in an item; the imbedded spell is normally usable once.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation Véritable","description":"Imprègne dans un objet un sort de Théurgie de n’importe quel niveau ; le sort imprégné est normalement utilisable une seule fois."},"en":{"name":"Imbed True","description":"Imbeds one Channeling spell of any level in an item; the imbedded spell is normally usable once."}}},{"spellList":"Own Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Lord Daily","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.LordDaily.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.LordDaily.description","level":60,"description":"Creates exceptionally powerful daily-use Channeling items with spells through 20th level; this is artifact-scale magic and requires GM approval.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien Seigneur","description":"Crée des objets de Théurgie à usage quotidien exceptionnellement puissants, contenant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 20 ; il s’agit d’une magie de niveau artefact nécessitant l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Lord Daily","description":"Creates exceptionally powerful daily-use Channeling items with spells through 20th level; this is artifact-scale magic and requires GM approval."}}},{"spellList":"Own Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Lord Constant","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.LordConstant.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.LordConstant.description","level":75,"description":"As Lord Daily, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Constant Seigneur","description":"Comme Quotidien Seigneur, mais les effets imprégnés appropriés peuvent fonctionner en permanence, sous réserve de l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Lord Constant","description":"As Lord Daily, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval."}}},{"spellList":"Own Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Daily True","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.DailyTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.DailyTrue.description","level":90,"description":"Creates daily-use Channeling items with spells through 50th level; this is artifact-scale magic requiring exceptional circumstances.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien Véritable","description":"Crée des objets de Théurgie à usage quotidien contenant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 50 ; il s’agit d’une magie de niveau artefact exigeant des circonstances exceptionnelles."},"en":{"name":"Daily True","description":"Creates daily-use Channeling items with spells through 50th level; this is artifact-scale magic requiring exceptional circumstances."}}}]},"_id":"KPupHf5TYOollvON"}
{"name":"Understanding Mastery","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/circled-gem-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herutano-understanding-mastery","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS/MERP","sourceBook":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5","sourceList":"Loremaster","sourcePage":240,"merpRealm":"Channeling","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Razak-zinul","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"merp-rmu-adapted-spell-list","reference":"Loremaster -> Understanding Mastery","merpMapping":"Loremaster mechanics adapted to MERP Herutano Understanding Mastery"},"compendiumSourceKey":"herutano-understanding-mastery","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-mentalism-herutano","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Maîtrise de la Compréhension","system":{"name":"Maîtrise de la Compréhension","label":"Maîtrise de la Compréhension","notesLabel":"Maîtrise de la Compréhension — notes","notes":"<h2>Maîtrise de la Compréhension</h2><p>Analyse des objets et machines, identification de leurs origines et capacités, et création d’enchantements généraux. La restriction de réanalyse après gain de niveau de l’ancienne Item Analysis reste applicable lorsque le MJ utilise cette règle source.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Understanding Mastery","system":{"name":"Understanding Mastery","label":"Understanding Mastery","notesLabel":"Understanding Mastery — notes","notes":"<h2>Understanding Mastery</h2><p>Analysis of objects, machines, origins, and capabilities, together with methods for understanding complex creations and magical workings. The old restriction on repeating certain analyses after a failure remains applicable when the GM uses that source rule.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Mentalisme","Herutano (Base)"],"en":["Mentalism Spell Lists","Herutano (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-mentalism","spell-lists-mentalism-herutano"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / MERP-RMSS v2.5","name":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","realms":"Mentalism","profession":"Herutano","notes":"<h2>Understanding Mastery</h2><p>Analysis of objects, machines, origins, and capabilities, together with methods for understanding complex creations and magical workings. The old restriction on repeating certain analyses after a failure remains applicable when the GM uses that source rule.</p>","label":"Understanding Mastery","notesLabel":"Understanding Mastery — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Detect Power","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.DetectPower.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.DetectPower.description","level":1,"description":"Detects whether an object contains power, without identifying its realm or strength.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Détection de la Puissance","description":"Détecte si un objet contient de la puissance, sans en identifier le royaume ni l’intensité."},"en":{"name":"Detect Power","description":"Detects whether an object contains power, without identifying its realm or strength."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Item Lore","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemLore.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemLore.description","level":2,"description":"Gives a basic idea of an item’s purpose, if any.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Connaissance des Objets","description":"Donne une idée générale de la fonction d’un objet, s’il en possède une."},"en":{"name":"Item Lore","description":"Gives a basic idea of an item’s purpose, if any."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Detect Curse","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.DetectCurse.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.DetectCurse.description","level":3,"description":"Detects whether an item is cursed.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Détection de Malédiction","description":"Détecte si un objet est maudit."},"en":{"name":"Detect Curse","description":"Detects whether an item is cursed."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Item Analysis I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisI.description","level":4,"description":"Provides a 10% chance per ability to determine the enchanted abilities of one item.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Analyse d’Objet I","description":"Donne 10 % de chances par capacité de déterminer chacune des capacités enchantées d’un objet."},"en":{"name":"Item Analysis I","description":"Provides a 10% chance per ability to determine the enchanted abilities of one item."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"General I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.GeneralI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.GeneralI.description","level":6,"description":"Allows the caster to enchant a general-purpose magic item with a Class I bonus.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hrs","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Général I","description":"Permet au lanceur d’enchanter un objet magique à usage général avec un bonus de Classe I."},"en":{"name":"General I","description":"Allows the caster to enchant a general-purpose magic item with a Class I bonus."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Machine Lore","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.MachineLore.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.MachineLore.description","level":7,"description":"Analyzes one machine, giving its purpose and operating procedures and a bonus when operating it.","aoe":"1 machine","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Connaissance des Machines","description":"Analyse une machine, révélant sa fonction et ses procédures d’utilisation et conférant un bonus pour la faire fonctionner."},"en":{"name":"Machine Lore","description":"Analyzes one machine, giving its purpose and operating procedures and a bonus when operating it."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Item Analysis II","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisII.description","level":8,"description":"As Item Analysis I, but with a 20% chance per ability.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Analyse d’Objet II","description":"Comme Analyse d’Objet I, mais avec 20 % de chances par capacité."},"en":{"name":"Item Analysis II","description":"As Item Analysis I, but with a 20% chance per ability."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Origins","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.Origins.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.Origins.description","level":9,"description":"Reveals the item’s area of origin, creator race, and approximate date of manufacture.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Origines","description":"Révèle la région d’origine de l’objet, la race de son créateur et sa date approximative de fabrication."},"en":{"name":"Origins","description":"Reveals the item’s area of origin, creator race, and approximate date of manufacture."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"General II","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.GeneralII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.GeneralII.description","level":10,"description":"As General I, but creates a stronger general enchantment.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hrs","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Général II","description":"Comme Général I, mais crée un enchantement général plus puissant."},"en":{"name":"General II","description":"As General I, but creates a stronger general enchantment."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Item Analysis III","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisIII.description","level":12,"description":"As Item Analysis I, with a greater chance to identify each ability.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Analyse d’Objet III","description":"Comme Analyse d’Objet I, mais avec une chance supérieure d’identifier chaque capacité."},"en":{"name":"Item Analysis III","description":"As Item Analysis I, with a greater chance to identify each ability."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Mechanition Lore","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.MechanitionLore.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.MechanitionLore.description","level":13,"description":"Provides advanced knowledge of a machine’s construction, operation and likely faults.","aoe":"1 machine","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Connaissance des Mécanismes","description":"Fournit une connaissance avancée de la construction, du fonctionnement et des pannes probables d’une machine."},"en":{"name":"Mechanition Lore","description":"Provides advanced knowledge of a machine’s construction, operation and likely faults."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"General III","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.GeneralIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.GeneralIII.description","level":15,"description":"As General I, but creates a stronger general enchantment.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hrs","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Général III","description":"Comme Général I, mais crée un enchantement général plus puissant."},"en":{"name":"General III","description":"As General I, but creates a stronger general enchantment."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Item Analysis IV","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisIV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisIV.description","level":16,"description":"As Item Analysis I, with a greater chance to identify each ability.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Analyse d’Objet IV","description":"Comme Analyse d’Objet I, mais avec une chance supérieure d’identifier chaque capacité."},"en":{"name":"Item Analysis IV","description":"As Item Analysis I, with a greater chance to identify each ability."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Engineering Lore","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.EngineeringLore.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.EngineeringLore.description","level":17,"description":"Gives the caster insight into engineering principles relevant to the examined construction or mechanism.","aoe":"caster","duration":"--","range":"self","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Connaissance de l’Ingénierie","description":"Donne au lanceur une compréhension des principes d’ingénierie pertinents pour la construction ou le mécanisme examiné."},"en":{"name":"Engineering Lore","description":"Gives the caster insight into engineering principles relevant to the examined construction or mechanism."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Item Analysis V","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisV.description","level":20,"description":"As Item Analysis I, with a greater chance to identify each ability.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Analyse d’Objet V","description":"Comme Analyse d’Objet I, mais avec une chance supérieure d’identifier chaque capacité."},"en":{"name":"Item Analysis V","description":"As Item Analysis I, with a greater chance to identify each ability."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Origins True","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.OriginsTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.OriginsTrue.description","level":25,"description":"Reveals substantially more precise information about the origins and history of one item.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Origines Véritables","description":"Révèle des informations nettement plus précises sur l’origine et l’histoire d’un objet."},"en":{"name":"Origins True","description":"Reveals substantially more precise information about the origins and history of one item."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Item Analysis VII","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisVII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisVII.description","level":30,"description":"As Item Analysis I, with a very high chance to identify each enchanted ability.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Analyse d’Objet VII","description":"Comme Analyse d’Objet I, mais avec une très forte chance d’identifier chaque capacité enchantée."},"en":{"name":"Item Analysis VII","description":"As Item Analysis I, with a very high chance to identify each enchanted ability."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"General IV","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.GeneralIV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.GeneralIV.description","level":35,"description":"As General I, but creates the strongest normal general enchantment on this list.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hrs","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Général IV","description":"Comme Général I, mais crée l’enchantement général normal le plus puissant de cette liste."},"en":{"name":"General IV","description":"As General I, but creates the strongest normal general enchantment on this list."}}},{"spellList":"Understanding Mastery","listType":"Base","profession":"Herutano","name":"Item Analysis True","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.loremaster.spells.ItemAnalysisTrue.description","level":50,"description":"Provides the list’s most complete magical analysis of one item.","aoe":"1 object","duration":"--","range":"touch","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Analyse d’Objet Véritable","description":"Fournit l’analyse magique la plus complète de cette liste pour un objet."},"en":{"name":"Item Analysis True","description":"Provides the list’s most complete magical analysis of one item."}}}]},"_id":"SLo5I9mxyXM7StBs"}
{"name":"Avian Ways","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-horned-white-purple.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"honnin-avian-ways","collection":"honnin-beta","contentVersion":1,"beta":true,"source":{"type":"rmss-honnin-spell-list","reference":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5 pp.231–233"},"compendiumSourceKey":"honnin-avian-ways","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/honnin-priest-beta-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-channeling-honnin","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Voies Aviaires","system":{"name":"Voies Aviaires","label":"Voies Aviaires","notesLabel":"Voies Aviaires — notes","notes":"<h2>Voies Aviaires</h2><p>Liste Honnin de Théurgie centrée sur les oiseaux : silence, dissimulation à leurs sens, langage, apprivoisement, appel et transformation. Les transformations utilisent les règles RMU de changement de forme lorsqu’elles sont applicables.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Avian Ways","system":{"name":"Avian Ways","label":"Avian Ways","notesLabel":"Avian Ways — notes","notes":"<h2>Avian Ways</h2><p>Honnin Channeling List centered on birds: silence, concealment from their senses, language, taming, calling, and transformation. Transformations use RMU shape-changing rules whenever applicable.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Théurgie","Prêtre Honnin (Base)"],"en":["Channeling Spell Lists","Honnin Priest (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-channeling","spell-lists-channeling-honnin"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU — Bêta","name":"Avian Ways","listType":"Base","realms":"Channeling","profession":"Honnin Priest","notes":"<h2>Avian Ways</h2><p>Honnin Channeling List centered on birds: silence, concealment from their senses, language, taming, calling, and transformation. Transformations use RMU shape-changing rules whenever applicable.</p>","label":"Avian Ways","notesLabel":"Avian Ways — notes","spells":[{"name":"Silence des Oiseaux (Silence Birds)","level":1,"description":"Tous les oiseaux dans la zone deviennent silencieux.","aoe":"20’R/niv","duration":"2 min/niv","range":"20’R/niv","spellType":"F","spellList":"Voies Aviaires (Avian Ways)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Silence des Oiseaux (Silence Birds)","descriptionLabel":"Silence des Oiseaux (Silence Birds) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Silence des Oiseaux","description":"Tous les oiseaux dans la zone deviennent silencieux."},"en":{"name":"Silence Birds","description":"All birds within the area become silent."}}},{"name":"Voile aux Oiseaux (Cloaking)","level":2,"description":"Le lanceur devient indétectable pour les oiseaux.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/niv","range":"self","spellType":"E","spellList":"Voies Aviaires (Avian Ways)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Voile aux Oiseaux (Cloaking)","descriptionLabel":"Voile aux Oiseaux (Cloaking) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Voile aux Oiseaux","description":"Le lanceur devient indétectable pour les oiseaux."},"en":{"name":"Cloaking","description":"The caster becomes undetectable to birds."}}},{"name":"Langage des Oiseaux (Bird Tongues)","level":3,"description":"Permet de comprendre et de parler le langage d’une espèce d’oiseau choisie.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/niv","range":"self","spellType":"I","spellList":"Voies Aviaires (Avian Ways)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Langage des Oiseaux (Bird Tongues)","descriptionLabel":"Langage des Oiseaux (Bird Tongues) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Langage des Oiseaux","description":"Permet de comprendre et de parler le langage d’une espèce d’oiseau choisie."},"en":{"name":"Bird Tongues","description":"Allows the caster to understand and speak the language of one chosen species of bird."}}},{"name":"Apprivoisement (Taming)","level":6,"description":"Permet d’apprivoiser un oiseau dont le niveau ne dépasse pas la moitié de celui du lanceur. Il sert son maître comme le ferait un animal loyal mais peu intelligent.","aoe":"1 oiseau","duration":"P","range":"10’/niv","spellType":"U","spellList":"Voies Aviaires (Avian Ways)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Apprivoisement (Taming)","descriptionLabel":"Apprivoisement (Taming) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Apprivoisement","description":"Permet d’apprivoiser un oiseau dont le niveau ne dépasse pas la moitié de celui du lanceur. Il sert son maître comme le ferait un animal loyal mais peu intelligent."},"en":{"name":"Taming","description":"Allows the caster to tame a bird whose level does not exceed half the caster’s level. It serves its master as a loyal but unintelligent animal would."}}},{"name":"Appel d’un Oiseau (Call Bird)","level":13,"description":"Appelle un oiseau précis et connu du lanceur. S’il peut matériellement rejoindre le lanceur, il vient à lui.","aoe":"1 oiseau","duration":"—","range":"1 mi/niv","spellType":"U","spellList":"Voies Aviaires (Avian Ways)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Appel d’un Oiseau (Call Bird)","descriptionLabel":"Appel d’un Oiseau (Call Bird) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Appel d’un Oiseau","description":"Appelle un oiseau précis et connu du lanceur. S’il peut matériellement rejoindre le lanceur, il vient à lui."},"en":{"name":"Call Bird","description":"Calls one specific bird known to the caster. If it can physically reach the caster, it comes to them."}}},{"name":"Forme d’Oiseau I (Bird Form I)","level":14,"description":"Le lanceur prend l’apparence et la texture d’un oiseau choisi, sans acquérir ses capacités physiques. Sa taille peut varier d’environ 75 % à 200 % de la taille normale de l’oiseau selon les limites fixées par le MJ.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/niv","range":"self","spellType":"U","spellList":"Voies Aviaires (Avian Ways)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Forme d’Oiseau I (Bird Form I)","descriptionLabel":"Forme d’Oiseau I (Bird Form I) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Forme d’Oiseau I","description":"Le lanceur prend l’apparence et la texture d’un oiseau choisi, sans acquérir ses capacités physiques. Sa taille peut varier d’environ 75 % à 200 % de la taille normale de l’oiseau selon les limites fixées par le MJ."},"en":{"name":"Bird Form I","description":"The caster takes on the appearance and texture of a chosen bird without gaining its physical capabilities. Size may vary from roughly 75% to 200% of the bird’s normal size, within limits set by the GM."}}},{"name":"Forme d’Oiseau II (Bird Form II)","level":16,"description":"Comme Forme d’Oiseau I, mais le lanceur acquiert les capacités de déplacement de l’oiseau, notamment le vol lorsqu’il est approprié.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/niv","range":"self","spellType":"U","spellList":"Voies Aviaires (Avian Ways)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Forme d’Oiseau II (Bird Form II)","descriptionLabel":"Forme d’Oiseau II (Bird Form II) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Forme d’Oiseau II","description":"Comme Forme d’Oiseau I, mais le lanceur acquiert les capacités de déplacement de l’oiseau, notamment le vol lorsqu’il est approprié."},"en":{"name":"Bird Form II","description":"As Bird Form I, but the caster also gains the bird’s movement capabilities, including flight when appropriate."}}},{"name":"Forme d’Oiseau III (Bird Form III)","level":19,"description":"Comme Forme d’Oiseau II, mais le lanceur acquiert également les attaques physiques naturelles de l’oiseau.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/niv","range":"self","spellType":"U","spellList":"Voies Aviaires (Avian Ways)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Forme d’Oiseau III (Bird Form III)","descriptionLabel":"Forme d’Oiseau III (Bird Form III) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Forme d’Oiseau III","description":"Comme Forme d’Oiseau II, mais le lanceur acquiert également les attaques physiques naturelles de l’oiseau."},"en":{"name":"Bird Form III","description":"As Bird Form II, but the caster also gains the bird’s natural physical attacks."}}},{"name":"Forme d’Oiseau Véritable (Bird Form True)","level":25,"description":"Comme Forme d’Oiseau III, mais le lanceur peut passer d’une forme d’oiseau à une autre pendant la durée du sort.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/niv","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Voies Aviaires (Avian Ways)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Forme d’Oiseau Véritable (Bird Form True)","descriptionLabel":"Forme d’Oiseau Véritable (Bird Form True) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Forme d’Oiseau Véritable","description":"Comme Forme d’Oiseau III, mais le lanceur peut passer d’une forme d’oiseau à une autre pendant la durée du sort."},"en":{"name":"Bird Form True","description":"As Bird Form III, but the caster may shift from one bird form to another during the spell’s duration."}}}]},"_id":"YVGvsaoajyJ6DMsm"}
{"name":"Communions","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-horned-white-purple.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"honnin-communions","collection":"honnin-beta","contentVersion":1,"beta":true,"source":{"type":"rmss-honnin-spell-list","reference":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5 pp.231–233"},"compendiumSourceKey":"honnin-communions","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/honnin-priest-beta-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-channeling-honnin","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Communions","system":{"name":"Communions","label":"Communions","notesLabel":"Communions — notes","notes":"<h2>Communions</h2><p>Liste Honnin de Théurgie consacrée à la perception des présences et au partage des sens, émotions et perceptions des oiseaux. Les effets sont adaptés du corpus RMSS/RMFRP et sont proposés en bêta.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Communions","system":{"name":"Communions","label":"Communions","notesLabel":"Communions — notes","notes":"<h2>Communions</h2><p>Honnin Channeling List devoted to sensing presences and sharing the senses, emotions, and perceptions of birds. The effects are adapted from the RMSS/RMFRP corpus and are presented in beta form.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Théurgie","Prêtre Honnin (Base)"],"en":["Channeling Spell Lists","Honnin Priest (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-channeling","spell-lists-channeling-honnin"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU — Bêta","name":"Communions","listType":"Base","realms":"Channeling","profession":"Honnin Priest","notes":"<h2>Communions</h2><p>Honnin Channeling List devoted to sensing presences and sharing the senses, emotions, and perceptions of birds. The effects are adapted from the RMSS/RMFRP corpus and are presented in beta form.</p>","label":"Communions","notesLabel":"Communions — notes","spells":[{"name":"Connaissance des Créatures (Creature Lore)","level":1,"description":"Le lanceur reçoit un bonus spécial de +10 à une Manœuvre utilisant une Compétence de Connaissance concernant la créature choisie.","aoe":"self","duration":"C","range":"sight","spellType":"P","spellList":"Communions (Communions)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Connaissance des Créatures (Creature Lore)","descriptionLabel":"Connaissance des Créatures (Creature Lore) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Connaissance des Créatures","description":"Le lanceur reçoit un bonus spécial de +10 à une Manœuvre utilisant une Compétence de Connaissance concernant la créature choisie."},"en":{"name":"Creature Lore","description":"The caster receives a special +10 bonus to one Maneuver using a Lore Skill concerning the chosen creature."}}},{"name":"Transe des Présences (Presence Trance)","level":2,"description":"Le lanceur perçoit la présence de tous les êtres — animaux et personnes — situés dans la zone, sans nécessairement en connaître l’identité précise.","aoe":"10’R/niv","duration":"C","range":"self","spellType":"U","spellList":"Communions (Communions)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Transe des Présences (Presence Trance)","descriptionLabel":"Transe des Présences (Presence Trance) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Transe des Présences","description":"Le lanceur perçoit la présence de tous les êtres — animaux et personnes — situés dans la zone, sans nécessairement en connaître l’identité précise."},"en":{"name":"Presence Trance","description":"The caster perceives the presence of all beings—animals and people—within the area without necessarily learning their exact identities."}}},{"name":"Communion I (Commune I)","level":3,"description":"Permet de partager les sentiments des oiseaux présents dans la portée et d’obtenir une impression plus précise de ce qu’ils perçoivent ou ressentent.","aoe":"self","duration":"C","range":"10’/niv","spellType":"P","spellList":"Communions (Communions)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Communion I (Commune I)","descriptionLabel":"Communion I (Commune I) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Communion I","description":"Permet de partager les sentiments des oiseaux présents dans la portée et d’obtenir une impression plus précise de ce qu’ils perçoivent ou ressentent."},"en":{"name":"Commune I","description":"Allows the caster to share the feelings of birds within range and gain a more precise impression of what they perceive or feel."}}},{"name":"Empathie Aviaire (Bird Empathy)","level":4,"description":"Permet de comprendre ou de visualiser les pensées et émotions d’un oiseau.","aoe":"1 oiseau","duration":"C","range":"100’","spellType":"I","spellList":"Communions (Communions)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Empathie Aviaire (Bird Empathy)","descriptionLabel":"Empathie Aviaire (Bird Empathy) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Empathie Aviaire","description":"Permet de comprendre ou de visualiser les pensées et émotions d’un oiseau."},"en":{"name":"Bird Empathy","description":"Allows the caster to understand or visualize a bird’s thoughts and emotions."}}},{"name":"Vue d’Oiseau I (Bird Sight I)","level":5,"description":"Le lanceur emprunte la vue d’un oiseau non intelligent à portée. L’oiseau doit être visible ou avoir été localisé par un effet de présence.","aoe":"caster + 1 cible","duration":"C","range":"100’","spellType":"Pm","spellList":"Communions (Communions)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Vue d’Oiseau I (Bird Sight I)","descriptionLabel":"Vue d’Oiseau I (Bird Sight I) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vue d’Oiseau I","description":"Le lanceur emprunte la vue d’un oiseau non intelligent à portée. L’oiseau doit être visible ou avoir été localisé par un effet de présence."},"en":{"name":"Bird Sight I","description":"The caster borrows the sight of a non-intelligent bird within range. The bird must be visible or have been located by a presence effect."}}},{"name":"Ouïe d’Oiseau (Bird Hearing)","level":6,"description":"Comme Vue d’Oiseau I, mais le lanceur emprunte l’ouïe de l’oiseau.","aoe":"caster + 1 cible","duration":"C","range":"100’","spellType":"Pm","spellList":"Communions (Communions)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Ouïe d’Oiseau (Bird Hearing)","descriptionLabel":"Ouïe d’Oiseau (Bird Hearing) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ouïe d’Oiseau","description":"Comme Vue d’Oiseau I, mais le lanceur emprunte l’ouïe de l’oiseau."},"en":{"name":"Bird Hearing","description":"As Bird Sight I, but the caster borrows the bird’s hearing."}}},{"name":"Contact Aviaire II (Touch Bird II)","level":7,"description":"Établit un contact avec un oiseau approprié à grande portée. Le lanceur peut préciser une direction et un type général d’oiseau ; il peut changer d’oiseau jusqu’à trois fois pendant la durée si des cibles appropriées sont disponibles.","aoe":"self","duration":"C","range":"100’/niv","spellType":"P","spellList":"Communions (Communions)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Contact Aviaire II (Touch Bird II)","descriptionLabel":"Contact Aviaire II (Touch Bird II) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Contact Aviaire II","description":"Établit un contact avec un oiseau approprié à grande portée. Le lanceur peut préciser une direction et un type général d’oiseau ; il peut changer d’oiseau jusqu’à trois fois pendant la durée si des cibles appropriées sont disponibles."},"en":{"name":"Touch Bird II","description":"Establishes contact with an appropriate bird at long range. The caster may specify a direction and a general type of bird and may switch birds up to three times during the duration if suitable targets are available."}}},{"name":"Vue d’Oiseau II (Bird Sight II)","level":8,"description":"Version étendue de Vue d’Oiseau I, permettant d’emprunter la vue d’un oiseau à beaucoup plus grande portée.","aoe":"self","duration":"C","range":"100’/niv","spellType":"P","spellList":"Communions (Communions)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Vue d’Oiseau II (Bird Sight II)","descriptionLabel":"Vue d’Oiseau II (Bird Sight II) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vue d’Oiseau II","description":"Version étendue de Vue d’Oiseau I, permettant d’emprunter la vue d’un oiseau à beaucoup plus grande portée."},"en":{"name":"Bird Sight II","description":"An extended version of Bird Sight I that allows the caster to borrow a bird’s sight at much greater range."}}},{"name":"Transe de Conscience (Awareness Trance)","level":9,"description":"Le lanceur étend sa conscience aux êtres présents dans une vaste zone et obtient une perception plus fine de leur position et de leur activité.","aoe":"10’R/niv","duration":"C","range":"self","spellType":"U","spellList":"Communions (Communions)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Transe de Conscience (Awareness Trance)","descriptionLabel":"Transe de Conscience (Awareness Trance) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Transe de Conscience","description":"Le lanceur étend sa conscience aux êtres présents dans une vaste zone et obtient une perception plus fine de leur position et de leur activité."},"en":{"name":"Awareness Trance","description":"The caster extends awareness to beings within a broad area and gains a more precise sense of their positions and activities."}}},{"name":"Communion Véritable (Commune True)","level":10,"description":"Établit une communion profonde avec les oiseaux sur une très grande distance, permettant une perception et un échange bien plus complets que Communion I.","aoe":"self","duration":"C","range":"20 mi/niv","spellType":"P","spellList":"Communions (Communions)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Communion Véritable (Commune True)","descriptionLabel":"Communion Véritable (Commune True) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Communion Véritable","description":"Établit une communion profonde avec les oiseaux sur une très grande distance, permettant une perception et un échange bien plus complets que Communion I."},"en":{"name":"Commune True","description":"Establishes a deep communion with birds over a very great distance, allowing much fuller perception and exchange than Commune I."}}}]},"_id":"ZgcHEj33MtrxWmLP"}
{"name":"Tattoo Crafts","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-horned-white-purple.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"honnin-tattoo-crafts","collection":"honnin-beta","contentVersion":1,"beta":true,"source":{"type":"rmss-honnin-spell-list","reference":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5 pp.231–233"},"compendiumSourceKey":"honnin-tattoo-crafts","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/honnin-priest-beta-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-channeling-honnin","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Artisanat du Tatouage","system":{"name":"Artisanat du Tatouage","label":"Artisanat du Tatouage","notesLabel":"Artisanat du Tatouage — notes","notes":"<h2>Artisanat du Tatouage</h2><p>Liste Honnin de Théurgie consacrée à la création de tatouages magiques. Dans cette adaptation bêta, elle devient une Liste de base du Prêtre Honnin.</p><p><strong>Règles particulières :</strong> seuls des sorts de Théurgie peuvent être imprégnés. Un tatouage magique mesure au minimum environ 2,5 × 2,5 cm ; deux tatouages magiques ne peuvent se croiser ; un tatouage ne peut porter qu’une seule capacité enchantée ; une personne ne peut porter plus de <strong>13 tatouages magiques</strong>.</p><p>Les Tatouages Généraux peuvent conférer des bonus ou propriétés. Les valeurs historiques sont conservées pour le bêta-test : Classe I/II/III/IV — Compétence +5/+10/+15/+20 ; Catégorie +2/+4/+6/+8 ; PV +5/+15/+30/+45 ; PP +2/+4/+6/+8 ; JR +5/+10/+15/+20 ; Adder +1/+2/+3/+4 ; multiplicateur de PP ×1,25/×1,5/×2/×3. <strong>Ces valeurs ne sont pas encore considérées comme équilibrées pour RMU et requièrent l’accord du MJ.</strong></p><p>Pour enchanter un bonus de Compétence ou de Catégorie, le tatoueur doit connaître personnellement la Compétence concernée et posséder un bonus au moins égal au double du bonus qu’il souhaite inscrire.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Tattoo Crafts","system":{"name":"Tattoo Crafts","label":"Tattoo Crafts","notesLabel":"Tattoo Crafts — notes","notes":"<h2>Tattoo Crafts</h2><p>Honnin Channeling List devoted to the creation of magical tattoos. In this beta adaptation, it becomes a Base List of the Honnin Priest.</p><p><strong>Special rules:</strong> only Channeling spells may be imbedded. A magical tattoo must measure at least about 2.5 × 2.5 cm; two magical tattoos may not overlap; a tattoo can hold only one enchanted ability; a person may bear no more than <strong>13 magical tattoos</strong>.</p><p>General Tattoos may grant bonuses or properties. Historical values are retained for beta testing: Class I/II/III/IV — Skill +5/+10/+15/+20; Category +2/+4/+6/+8; hits +5/+15/+30/+45; PP +2/+4/+6/+8; RR +5/+10/+15/+20; Adder +1/+2/+3/+4; PP multiplier ×1.25/×1.5/×2/×3. <strong>These values are not yet considered balanced for RMU and require GM approval.</strong></p><p>To enchant a Skill or Category bonus, the tattooist must personally know the Skill concerned and possess a bonus at least twice as high as the bonus they wish to inscribe.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Théurgie","Prêtre Honnin (Base)"],"en":["Channeling Spell Lists","Honnin Priest (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-channeling","spell-lists-channeling-honnin"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU — Bêta","name":"Tattoo Crafts","listType":"Base","realms":"Channeling","profession":"Honnin Priest","notes":"<h2>Tattoo Crafts</h2><p>Honnin Channeling List devoted to the creation of magical tattoos. In this beta adaptation, it becomes a Base List of the Honnin Priest.</p><p><strong>Special rules:</strong> only Channeling spells may be imbedded. A magical tattoo must measure at least about 2.5 × 2.5 cm; two magical tattoos may not overlap; a tattoo can hold only one enchanted ability; a person may bear no more than <strong>13 magical tattoos</strong>.</p><p>General Tattoos may grant bonuses or properties. Historical values are retained for beta testing: Class I/II/III/IV — Skill +5/+10/+15/+20; Category +2/+4/+6/+8; hits +5/+15/+30/+45; PP +2/+4/+6/+8; RR +5/+10/+15/+20; Adder +1/+2/+3/+4; PP multiplier ×1.25/×1.5/×2/×3. <strong>These values are not yet considered balanced for RMU and require GM approval.</strong></p><p>To enchant a Skill or Category bonus, the tattooist must personally know the Skill concerned and possess a bonus at least twice as high as the bonus they wish to inscribe.</p>","label":"Tattoo Crafts","notesLabel":"Tattoo Crafts — notes","spells":[{"name":"Création du Tatouage (Make Tattoo)","level":1,"description":"Permet au lanceur de réaliser sans défaut un tatouage sur une chair non magique, à condition de disposer des outils et pigments nécessaires. Le temps de travail est réduit de moitié.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Création du Tatouage (Make Tattoo)","descriptionLabel":"Création du Tatouage (Make Tattoo) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Création du Tatouage","description":"Permet au lanceur de réaliser sans défaut un tatouage sur une chair non magique, à condition de disposer des outils et pigments nécessaires. Le temps de travail est réduit de moitié."},"en":{"name":"Make Tattoo","description":"Allows the caster to flawlessly create a tattoo on non-magical flesh, provided the necessary tools and pigments are available. Working time is halved."}}},{"name":"Tatouage I (Tattoo I)","level":2,"description":"Prépare un tatouage afin qu’il puisse recevoir un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage I (Tattoo I)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage I (Tattoo I) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage I","description":"Prépare un tatouage afin qu’il puisse recevoir un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1."},"en":{"name":"Tattoo I","description":"Prepares a tattoo so that it can receive a 1st-level Channeling spell."}}},{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage I (Imbed Tattoo I)","level":3,"description":"Imprègne dans un tatouage préparé un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Imprégnation du Tatouage I (Imbed Tattoo I)","descriptionLabel":"Imprégnation du Tatouage I (Imbed Tattoo I) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage I","description":"Imprègne dans un tatouage préparé un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1."},"en":{"name":"Imbed Tattoo I","description":"Imbeds a 1st-level Channeling spell into a prepared tattoo."}}},{"name":"Tatouage II (Tattoo II)","level":4,"description":"Comme Tatouage I, mais le tatouage peut recevoir un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1 ou 2.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage II (Tattoo II)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage II (Tattoo II) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage II","description":"Comme Tatouage I, mais le tatouage peut recevoir un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1 ou 2."},"en":{"name":"Tattoo II","description":"As Tattoo I, but the tattoo can receive a 1st- or 2nd-level Channeling spell."}}},{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage II (Imbed Tattoo II)","level":5,"description":"Comme Imprégnation du Tatouage I, mais permet d’inscrire un sort de niveau 1 ou 2.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Imprégnation du Tatouage II (Imbed Tattoo II)","descriptionLabel":"Imprégnation du Tatouage II (Imbed Tattoo II) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage II","description":"Comme Imprégnation du Tatouage I, mais permet d’inscrire un sort de niveau 1 ou 2."},"en":{"name":"Imbed Tattoo II","description":"As Imbed Tattoo I, but allows a 1st- or 2nd-level spell to be imbedded."}}},{"name":"Tatouage Général I (General Tattoo I)","level":6,"description":"Prépare un tatouage afin qu’il puisse recevoir un effet général de Classe I. Les valeurs de la table Honnin sont conservées à titre bêta et doivent être validées par le MJ.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage Général I (General Tattoo I)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage Général I (General Tattoo I) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage Général I","description":"Prépare un tatouage afin qu’il puisse recevoir un effet général de Classe I. Les valeurs de la table Honnin sont conservées à titre bêta et doivent être validées par le MJ."},"en":{"name":"General Tattoo I","description":"Prepares a tattoo so that it can receive a Class I general effect. The values from the Honnin table are retained for beta testing and require GM approval."}}},{"name":"Tatouage Quotidien I (Daily Tattoo I)","level":7,"description":"Permet d’imprégner un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1 dans un tatouage afin qu’il puisse être utilisé une fois par jour.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage Quotidien I (Daily Tattoo I)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage Quotidien I (Daily Tattoo I) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage Quotidien I","description":"Permet d’imprégner un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1 dans un tatouage afin qu’il puisse être utilisé une fois par jour."},"en":{"name":"Daily Tattoo I","description":"Allows a 1st-level Channeling spell to be imbedded in a tattoo for use once per day."}}},{"name":"Tatouage IV (Tattoo IV)","level":8,"description":"Comme Tatouage I, jusqu’au niveau 4.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage IV (Tattoo IV)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage IV (Tattoo IV) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage IV","description":"Comme Tatouage I, jusqu’au niveau 4."},"en":{"name":"Tattoo IV","description":"As Tattoo I, up to 4th level."}}},{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage IV (Imbed Tattoo IV)","level":9,"description":"Comme Imprégnation du Tatouage I, pour un sort de niveau 1 à 4.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Imprégnation du Tatouage IV (Imbed Tattoo IV)","descriptionLabel":"Imprégnation du Tatouage IV (Imbed Tattoo IV) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage IV","description":"Comme Imprégnation du Tatouage I, pour un sort de niveau 1 à 4."},"en":{"name":"Imbed Tattoo IV","description":"As Imbed Tattoo I, for a spell from 1st through 4th level."}}},{"name":"Tatouage Général II (General Tattoo II)","level":10,"description":"Comme Tatouage Général I, mais permet un effet général de Classe II.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage Général II (General Tattoo II)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage Général II (General Tattoo II) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage Général II","description":"Comme Tatouage Général I, mais permet un effet général de Classe II."},"en":{"name":"General Tattoo II","description":"As General Tattoo I, but allows a Class II general effect."}}},{"name":"Tatouage Constant II (Constant Tattoo II)","level":11,"description":"Permet d’imprégner un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1 ou 2 afin qu’il fonctionne en permanence ou à volonté, selon la nature du sort et l’accord du MJ.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage Constant II (Constant Tattoo II)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage Constant II (Constant Tattoo II) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage Constant II","description":"Permet d’imprégner un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1 ou 2 afin qu’il fonctionne en permanence ou à volonté, selon la nature du sort et l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Constant Tattoo II","description":"Allows a 1st- or 2nd-level Channeling spell to be imbedded so that it functions continuously or at will, depending on the nature of the spell and GM approval."}}},{"name":"Tatouage Quotidien III (Daily Tattoo III)","level":12,"description":"Permet d’imprégner un sort de niveau 1 à 3 : niveau 1 jusqu’à trois fois par jour ; niveaux 2 ou 3 une fois par jour.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage Quotidien III (Daily Tattoo III)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage Quotidien III (Daily Tattoo III) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage Quotidien III","description":"Permet d’imprégner un sort de niveau 1 à 3 : niveau 1 jusqu’à trois fois par jour ; niveaux 2 ou 3 une fois par jour."},"en":{"name":"Daily Tattoo III","description":"Allows a 1st- to 3rd-level spell to be imbedded: a 1st-level spell up to three times per day; 2nd- or 3rd-level spells once per day."}}},{"name":"Tatouage VI (Tattoo VI)","level":13,"description":"Comme Tatouage I, jusqu’au niveau 6.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage VI (Tattoo VI)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage VI (Tattoo VI) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage VI","description":"Comme Tatouage I, jusqu’au niveau 6."},"en":{"name":"Tattoo VI","description":"As Tattoo I, up to 6th level."}}},{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage VI (Imbed Tattoo VI)","level":14,"description":"Comme Imprégnation du Tatouage I, pour un sort de niveau 1 à 6.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Imprégnation du Tatouage VI (Imbed Tattoo VI)","descriptionLabel":"Imprégnation du Tatouage VI (Imbed Tattoo VI) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage VI","description":"Comme Imprégnation du Tatouage I, pour un sort de niveau 1 à 6."},"en":{"name":"Imbed Tattoo VI","description":"As Imbed Tattoo I, for a spell from 1st through 6th level."}}},{"name":"Tatouage Général III (General Tattoo III)","level":15,"description":"Comme Tatouage Général I, mais permet un effet général de Classe III.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage Général III (General Tattoo III)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage Général III (General Tattoo III) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage Général III","description":"Comme Tatouage Général I, mais permet un effet général de Classe III."},"en":{"name":"General Tattoo III","description":"As General Tattoo I, but allows a Class III general effect."}}},{"name":"Tatouage Quotidien V (Daily Tattoo V)","level":16,"description":"Permet d’imprégner un sort de niveau 1 à 5 : niveau 1 jusqu’à cinq fois par jour ; niveaux 2–3 deux fois ; niveaux 4–5 une fois.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage Quotidien V (Daily Tattoo V)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage Quotidien V (Daily Tattoo V) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage Quotidien V","description":"Permet d’imprégner un sort de niveau 1 à 5 : niveau 1 jusqu’à cinq fois par jour ; niveaux 2–3 deux fois ; niveaux 4–5 une fois."},"en":{"name":"Daily Tattoo V","description":"Allows a 1st- to 5th-level spell to be imbedded: 1st level up to five times per day; 2nd–3rd levels twice per day; 4th–5th levels once per day."}}},{"name":"Tatouage VIII (Tattoo VIII)","level":17,"description":"Comme Tatouage I, jusqu’au niveau 8.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage VIII (Tattoo VIII)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage VIII (Tattoo VIII) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage VIII","description":"Comme Tatouage I, jusqu’au niveau 8."},"en":{"name":"Tattoo VIII","description":"As Tattoo I, up to 8th level."}}},{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage VIII (Imbed Tattoo VIII)","level":18,"description":"Comme Imprégnation du Tatouage I, pour un sort de niveau 1 à 8.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Imprégnation du Tatouage VIII (Imbed Tattoo VIII)","descriptionLabel":"Imprégnation du Tatouage VIII (Imbed Tattoo VIII) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage VIII","description":"Comme Imprégnation du Tatouage I, pour un sort de niveau 1 à 8."},"en":{"name":"Imbed Tattoo VIII","description":"As Imbed Tattoo I, for a spell from 1st through 8th level."}}},{"name":"Création du Tatouage Véritable (Make Tattoo True)","level":19,"description":"Permet de réaliser sans défaut un tatouage sur une chair magique. Les outils et matériaux requis doivent être présents ; le temps de travail est réduit de moitié.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Création du Tatouage Véritable (Make Tattoo True)","descriptionLabel":"Création du Tatouage Véritable (Make Tattoo True) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Création du Tatouage Véritable","description":"Permet de réaliser sans défaut un tatouage sur une chair magique. Les outils et matériaux requis doivent être présents ; le temps de travail est réduit de moitié."},"en":{"name":"Make Tattoo True","description":"Allows the caster to flawlessly create a tattoo on magical flesh. The required tools and materials must be available; working time is halved."}}},{"name":"Tatouage X (Tattoo X)","level":20,"description":"Comme Tatouage I, jusqu’au niveau 10.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage X (Tattoo X)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage X (Tattoo X) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage X","description":"Comme Tatouage I, jusqu’au niveau 10."},"en":{"name":"Tattoo X","description":"As Tattoo I, up to 10th level."}}},{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage X (Imbed Tattoo X)","level":25,"description":"Comme Imprégnation du Tatouage I, pour un sort de niveau 1 à 10.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Imprégnation du Tatouage X (Imbed Tattoo X)","descriptionLabel":"Imprégnation du Tatouage X (Imbed Tattoo X) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation du Tatouage X","description":"Comme Imprégnation du Tatouage I, pour un sort de niveau 1 à 10."},"en":{"name":"Imbed Tattoo X","description":"As Imbed Tattoo I, for a spell from 1st through 10th level."}}},{"name":"Tatouage Général IV (General Tattoo IV)","level":35,"description":"Comme Tatouage Général I, mais permet un effet général de Classe IV.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage Général IV (General Tattoo IV)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage Général IV (General Tattoo IV) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage Général IV","description":"Comme Tatouage Général I, mais permet un effet général de Classe IV."},"en":{"name":"General Tattoo IV","description":"As General Tattoo I, but allows a Class IV general effect."}}},{"name":"Tatouage Constant X (Constant Tattoo X)","level":50,"description":"Comme Tatouage Constant II, mais permet d’imprégner un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1 à 10.","aoe":"1 tatouage","duration":"24 h","range":"self","spellType":"F","spellList":"Artisanat du Tatouage (Tattoo Crafts)","listType":"Base","profession":"Honnin Priest","label":"Tatouage Constant X (Constant Tattoo X)","descriptionLabel":"Tatouage Constant X (Constant Tattoo X) description","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tatouage Constant X","description":"Comme Tatouage Constant II, mais permet d’imprégner un sort de Théurgie de niveau 1 à 10."},"en":{"name":"Constant Tattoo X","description":"As Constant Tattoo II, but allows a 1st- through 10th-level Channeling spell to be imbedded."}}}]},"_id":"sriZQdLbIHfXsFA5"}
{"name":"Nature's Summons","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-horned-white-purple.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"ranger-natures-summons","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS","sourceBook":"Spell Law","sourceList":"Nature's Summons","sourcePage":50,"merpRealm":"Channeling","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Rôdeur","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"RMSS Spell Law p.50 — Ranger Base List 2.6.4; MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5 — Ranger"},"compendiumSourceKey":"ranger-natures-summons","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-channeling-ranger","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Invocations de la Nature","system":{"name":"Invocations de la Nature","label":"Invocations de la Nature","notesLabel":"Invocations de la Nature — notes","notes":"<h2>Invocations de la Nature</h2><p>Liste de base du Rôdeur restaurée depuis RMSS pour MERP-RMU. Elle combine l’appel d’animaux locaux, l’accélération de la croissance végétale et des prières météorologiques.</p><p><strong>Animaux :</strong> les animaux appelés doivent normalement exister dans la région et pouvoir atteindre le lanceur ; ils ne sont pas créés par le sort. Un animal appelé quitte normalement le lanceur à l’expiration du sort.</p><p><strong>Prières :</strong> les sorts de prière exigent que le lanceur soit dehors et consacre au moins une minute à la prière. La météo demandée apparaît progressivement si la prière est exaucée et suit ensuite son cours naturel.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Nature's Summons","system":{"name":"Nature's Summons","label":"Nature's Summons","notesLabel":"Nature's Summons — notes","notes":"<h2>Nature's Summons</h2><p>Ranger Base List restored from RMSS for MERP-RMU. It combines the summoning of local animals, accelerated plant growth, and weather prayers.</p><p><strong>Animals:</strong> summoned animals must normally exist in the region and be able to reach the caster; they are not created by the spell. A summoned animal normally leaves the caster when the spell expires.</p><p><strong>Prayers:</strong> prayer spells require the caster to be outdoors and to devote at least one minute to prayer. If the prayer is granted, the requested weather develops gradually and then follows its natural course.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Théurgie","Rôdeur (Base)"],"en":["Channeling Spell Lists","Ranger (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-channeling","spell-lists-channeling-ranger"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / RMSS Spell Law","name":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","realms":"Channeling","profession":"Rôdeur","notes":"<h2>Nature's Summons</h2><p>Ranger Base List restored from RMSS for MERP-RMU. It combines the summoning of local animals, accelerated plant growth, and weather prayers.</p><p><strong>Animals:</strong> summoned animals must normally exist in the region and be able to reach the caster; they are not created by the spell. A summoned animal normally leaves the caster when the spell expires.</p><p><strong>Prayers:</strong> prayer spells require the caster to be outdoors and to devote at least one minute to prayer. If the prayer is granted, the requested weather develops gradually and then follows its natural course.</p>","label":"Nature's Summons","notesLabel":"Nature's Summons — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Summon Nourishment","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Nourishment.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Nourishment.description","level":1,"description":"An animal arrives carrying some form of nourishment for the caster, such as berries, nuts, tubers, or other vegetable food. The animal drops the food and returns to the wilderness.","aoe":"1 creature","duration":"--","range":"varies","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Invocation de Nourriture","description":"Un animal arrive en apportant au lanceur une forme de nourriture, comme des baies, des noix, des tubercules ou d’autres aliments végétaux. L’animal dépose la nourriture puis retourne dans la nature."},"en":{"name":"Summon Nourishment","description":"An animal arrives carrying some form of nourishment for the caster, such as berries, nuts, tubers, or other vegetable food. The animal drops the food and returns to the wilderness."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Summon Warmth","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Warmth.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Warmth.description","level":2,"description":"A heavily furred animal arrives and lies down near the caster. The animal allows the caster, and only the caster, to lie beside it for warmth.","aoe":"1 creature","duration":"8 hours","range":"varies","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Invocation de Chaleur","description":"Un animal à la fourrure épaisse arrive et se couche près du lanceur. Il permet au lanceur, et à lui seul, de se blottir contre lui pour se réchauffer."},"en":{"name":"Summon Warmth","description":"A heavily furred animal arrives and lies down near the caster. The animal allows the caster, and only the caster, to lie beside it for warmth."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Summon Guide","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Guide.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Guide.description","level":3,"description":"An animal that knows the path to a specified location arrives and guides the caster. It continues only while the caster concentrates or until the destination is reached.","aoe":"1 creature","duration":"24 hours (C)","range":"varies","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Invocation d’un Guide","description":"Un animal connaissant le chemin vers un lieu désigné arrive et guide le lanceur. Il poursuit sa route tant que le lanceur se concentre ou jusqu’à ce que la destination soit atteinte."},"en":{"name":"Summon Guide","description":"An animal that knows the path to a specified location arrives and guides the caster. It continues only while the caster concentrates or until the destination is reached."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Summon Guardian","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Guardian.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Guardian.description","level":4,"description":"A suitable large animal arrives and attempts to protect the caster from hostile attacks for the duration. It protects only while the caster remains near it and does not itself initiate hostile action through the caster.","aoe":"1 creature","duration":"8 hours","range":"varies","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Invocation d’un Gardien","description":"Un grand animal approprié arrive et tente de protéger le lanceur contre les attaques hostiles pendant la durée du sort. Il ne protège le lanceur que tant que celui-ci reste près de lui et n’engage pas lui-même d’action hostile par l’intermédiaire du lanceur."},"en":{"name":"Summon Guardian","description":"A suitable large animal arrives and attempts to protect the caster from hostile attacks for the duration. It protects only while the caster remains near it and does not itself initiate hostile action through the caster."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Summon Mount","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Mount.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Mount.description","level":5,"description":"A large animal arrives and serves as a mount for the caster for the duration.","aoe":"1 creature","duration":"24 hours","range":"varies","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Invocation d’une Monture","description":"Un grand animal arrive et sert de monture au lanceur pendant la durée du sort."},"en":{"name":"Summon Mount","description":"A large animal arrives and serves as a mount for the caster for the duration."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Summon Hunter","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Hunter.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Hunter.description","level":6,"description":"An animal arrives carrying recently killed prey suitable as food. It drops the prey near the caster and then returns to the wilderness.","aoe":"1 creature","duration":"--","range":"varies","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Invocation d’un Chasseur","description":"Un animal arrive en transportant une proie récemment tuée et propre à la consommation. Il dépose la proie près du lanceur puis retourne dans la nature."},"en":{"name":"Summon Hunter","description":"An animal arrives carrying recently killed prey suitable as food. It drops the prey near the caster and then returns to the wilderness."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Summon Sense","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Sense.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Sense.description","level":7,"description":"An animal with a particularly keen sense arrives. While concentrating, the caster can have the animal communicate what it perceives with that sense.","aoe":"1 creature","duration":"24 hours (C)","range":"varies","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Invocation d’un Sens","description":"Un animal doté d’un sens particulièrement développé arrive. Tant qu’il se concentre, le lanceur peut lui faire communiquer ce qu’il perçoit grâce à ce sens."},"en":{"name":"Summon Sense","description":"An animal with a particularly keen sense arrives. While concentrating, the caster can have the animal communicate what it perceives with that sense."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Summon Group","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Group.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Summon Group.description","level":9,"description":"A group of animals arrives and remains near the area where the spell was cast. The summoned animals must normally be creatures that naturally travel in groups.","aoe":"1 group","duration":"24 hours","range":"varies","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Invocation d’un Groupe","description":"Un groupe d’animaux arrive et demeure à proximité de la zone où le sort a été lancé. Les animaux invoqués doivent normalement appartenir à des espèces vivant naturellement en groupe."},"en":{"name":"Summon Group","description":"A group of animals arrives and remains near the area where the spell was cast. The summoned animals must normally be creatures that naturally travel in groups."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Mass Summons","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Mass Summons.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Mass Summons.description","level":10,"description":"The caster may use any lower-level animal-summoning spell from this list to summon one animal per caster level. All summoned animals serve only the caster.","aoe":"1 creature/lvl","duration":"varies","range":"varies","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Invocations de Masse","description":"Le lanceur peut utiliser n’importe quel sort d’invocation animale de niveau inférieur de cette liste pour invoquer un animal par niveau du lanceur. Tous les animaux invoqués ne servent que le lanceur."},"en":{"name":"Mass Summons","description":"The caster may use any lower-level animal-summoning spell from this list to summon one animal per caster level. All summoned animals serve only the caster."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Spread Plants","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Spread Plants.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Spread Plants.description","level":12,"description":"Produces a ground covering of grasses and small plants of other varieties. The plants must already exist in the area of effect; the spell accelerates multiplication and growth.","aoe":"20'R","duration":"P","range":"10'","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Propagation des Plantes","description":"Produit un tapis de graminées et de petites plantes d’autres variétés. Les plantes doivent déjà exister dans la zone d’effet ; le sort accélère leur multiplication et leur croissance."},"en":{"name":"Spread Plants","description":"Produces a ground covering of grasses and small plants of other varieties. The plants must already exist in the area of effect; the spell accelerates multiplication and growth."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Fog Prayer","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Fog Prayer.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Fog Prayer.description","level":13,"description":"The caster prays to the deity or spiritual power for fog. The base chance that the prayer is answered is 2% per caster level, modified by how natural such weather is for the region and season.","aoe":"500'R/lvl","duration":"varies","range":"10'","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Prière de Brouillard","description":"Le lanceur prie une divinité ou une puissance spirituelle afin d’obtenir du brouillard. La probabilité de base que la prière soit exaucée est de 2 % par niveau du lanceur, modifiée selon le caractère naturel de ce temps pour la région et la saison."},"en":{"name":"Fog Prayer","description":"The caster prays to the deity or spiritual power for fog. The base chance that the prayer is answered is 2% per caster level, modified by how natural such weather is for the region and season."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Rain Prayer","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Rain Prayer.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Rain Prayer.description","level":14,"description":"As Fog Prayer, except the requested weather is a gentle light rain.","aoe":"500'R/lvl","duration":"varies","range":"10'","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Prière de Pluie","description":"Comme Prière de Brouillard, mais le temps demandé est une pluie fine et douce."},"en":{"name":"Rain Prayer","description":"As Fog Prayer, except the requested weather is a gentle light rain."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Spread Plants II","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Spread Plants II.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Spread Plants II.description","level":15,"description":"As Spread Plants, except the effect also promotes the growth and spread of small trees.","aoe":"20'R","duration":"P","range":"10'","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Propagation des Plantes II","description":"Comme Propagation des Plantes, mais l’effet favorise aussi la croissance et la propagation de petits arbres."},"en":{"name":"Spread Plants II","description":"As Spread Plants, except the effect also promotes the growth and spread of small trees."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Storm Prayer","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Storm Prayer.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Storm Prayer.description","level":16,"description":"As Fog Prayer, except the requested weather is a heavy thunderstorm.","aoe":"500'R/lvl","duration":"varies","range":"10'","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Prière de Tempête","description":"Comme Prière de Brouillard, mais le temps demandé est un violent orage."},"en":{"name":"Storm Prayer","description":"As Fog Prayer, except the requested weather is a heavy thunderstorm."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Hail Prayer","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Hail Prayer.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Hail Prayer.description","level":17,"description":"As Fog Prayer, except the requested weather is a hailstorm.","aoe":"500'R/lvl","duration":"varies","range":"10'","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Prière de Grêle","description":"Comme Prière de Brouillard, mais le temps demandé est une tempête de grêle."},"en":{"name":"Hail Prayer","description":"As Fog Prayer, except the requested weather is a hailstorm."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Lightning Prayer","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Lightning Prayer.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Lightning Prayer.description","level":18,"description":"As Fog Prayer, except the requested weather is a lightning storm.","aoe":"500'R/lvl","duration":"varies","range":"10'","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Prière de Foudre","description":"Comme Prière de Brouillard, mais le temps demandé est un orage de foudre."},"en":{"name":"Lightning Prayer","description":"As Fog Prayer, except the requested weather is a lightning storm."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Tornado Prayer","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Tornado Prayer.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Tornado Prayer.description","level":20,"description":"As Fog Prayer, except the requested weather includes a tornado.","aoe":"500'R/lvl","duration":"varies","range":"10'","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Prière de Tornade","description":"Comme Prière de Brouillard, mais le temps demandé comprend une tornade."},"en":{"name":"Tornado Prayer","description":"As Fog Prayer, except the requested weather includes a tornado."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Clear Weather Prayer","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Clear Weather Prayer.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Clear Weather Prayer.description","level":25,"description":"As Fog Prayer, except the prayer requests and, if answered, ensures clear weather.","aoe":"500'R/lvl","duration":"varies","range":"10'","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Prière de Temps Clair","description":"Comme Prière de Brouillard, mais la prière demande et, si elle est exaucée, garantit un temps clair."},"en":{"name":"Clear Weather Prayer","description":"As Fog Prayer, except the prayer requests and, if answered, ensures clear weather."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Weather Prayer True","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Weather Prayer True.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Weather Prayer True.description","level":30,"description":"As Fog Prayer, except the power petitioned grants whatever weather would be most beneficial to the caster’s current goal.","aoe":"500'R/lvl","duration":"varies","range":"10'","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Prière Météorologique Véritable","description":"Comme Prière de Brouillard, mais la puissance sollicitée accorde les conditions météorologiques les plus favorables à l’objectif actuel du lanceur."},"en":{"name":"Weather Prayer True","description":"As Fog Prayer, except the power petitioned grants whatever weather would be most beneficial to the caster’s current goal."}}},{"spellList":"Nature's Summons","listType":"Base","profession":"Rôdeur","name":"Prayer Mastery","label":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Prayer Mastery.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.NaturesSummons.spells.Prayer Mastery.description","level":50,"description":"The caster may use any lower-level Prayer spell on this list; the chance that the prayer is answered is 95%.","aoe":"500'R/lvl","duration":"varies","range":"10'","spellType":"E","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Maîtrise des Prières","description":"Le lanceur peut utiliser n’importe quel sort de Prière de niveau inférieur de cette liste ; la probabilité que la prière soit exaucée est de 95 %."},"en":{"name":"Prayer Mastery","description":"The caster may use any lower-level Prayer spell on this list; the chance that the prayer is answered is 95%."}}}]},"_id":"XeX44xpDRNlNZCtk"}
{"name":"Armourer","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-horned-white-purple.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"razak-zinul-armourer","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS/MERP","sourceBook":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5","sourceList":"Armourer","sourcePage":234,"merpRealm":"Channeling","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Razak-zinul","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"merp-rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"MERP/RMSS v2.5 pp. 234; Razak-zinul Base List"},"compendiumSourceKey":"razak-zinul-armourer","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-channeling-razak-zinul","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Armurier","system":{"name":"Armurier","label":"Armurier","notesLabel":"Armurier — notes","notes":"<h2>Armurier</h2><p>Liste de forge défensive du Razak-Zinul : boucliers de force, renforcement des défenses et enchantement d’armures et de vêtements protecteurs.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Armourer","system":{"name":"Armourer","label":"Armourer","notesLabel":"Armourer — notes","notes":"<h2>Armourer</h2><p>Razak-Zinul defensive forging List: force shields, strengthened defenses, and enchantment of armor and protective clothing.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Théurgie","Razak-Zinul (Base)"],"en":["Channeling Spell Lists","Razak-Zinul (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-channeling","spell-lists-channeling-razak-zinul"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / MERP-RMSS v2.5","name":"Armourer","listType":"Base","realms":"Channeling","profession":"Razak-zinul","notes":"<h2>Armourer</h2><p>Razak-Zinul defensive forging List: force shields, strengthened defenses, and enchantment of armor and protective clothing.</p>","label":"Armourer","notesLabel":"Armourer — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Armourer","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Shield","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.Shield.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.Shield.description","level":2,"description":"Creates an invisible force shield in front of the caster. It functions like a normal shield but occupies no hand and cannot be combined with a real shield.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Bouclier","description":"Crée devant le lanceur un bouclier de force invisible. Il fonctionne comme un bouclier normal, mais n’occupe aucune main et ne peut pas être combiné avec un bouclier réel."},"en":{"name":"Shield","description":"Creates an invisible force shield in front of the caster. It functions like a normal shield but occupies no hand and cannot be combined with a real shield."}}},{"spellList":"Armourer","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Shield Defense I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ShieldDefenseI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ShieldDefenseI.description","level":3,"description":"Improves the caster’s shield DB by +5.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Défense au Bouclier I","description":"Améliore de +5 la BD de bouclier du lanceur."},"en":{"name":"Shield Defense I","description":"Improves the caster’s shield DB by +5."}}},{"spellList":"Armourer","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Armour Defense I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ArmourDefenseI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ArmourDefenseI.description","level":4,"description":"Improves the caster’s armour DB by +5.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Défense d’Armure I","description":"Améliore de +5 la BD d’armure du lanceur."},"en":{"name":"Armour Defense I","description":"Improves the caster’s armour DB by +5."}}},{"spellList":"Armourer","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Armour I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ArmourI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ArmourI.description","level":5,"description":"Enchants armour or a shield with a +5 general magical bonus or a +10 bonus against one broad group.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hrs","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Armure I","description":"Enchante une armure ou un bouclier en lui conférant un bonus magique général de +5 ou +10 contre un vaste groupe de créatures."},"en":{"name":"Armour I","description":"Enchants armour or a shield with a +5 general magical bonus or a +10 bonus against one broad group."}}},{"spellList":"Armourer","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Enchant Cloth I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.EnchantClothI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.EnchantClothI.description","level":6,"description":"Enchants the caster’s clothing to protect as a heavier armour type according to the source list.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Enchantement du Tissu I","description":"Enchante les vêtements du lanceur afin qu’ils protègent comme un type d’armure plus lourd, conformément à la liste d’origine."},"en":{"name":"Enchant Cloth I","description":"Enchants the caster’s clothing to protect as a heavier armour type according to the source list."}}},{"spellList":"Armourer","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Shield Defense II","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ShieldDefenseII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ShieldDefenseII.description","level":7,"description":"As Shield Defense I, but the bonus is +10.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Défense au Bouclier II","description":"Comme Défense au Bouclier I, mais le bonus est de +10."},"en":{"name":"Shield Defense II","description":"As Shield Defense I, but the bonus is +10."}}},{"spellList":"Armourer","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Armour Defense II","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ArmourDefenseII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ArmourDefenseII.description","level":8,"description":"As Armour Defense I, but the bonus is +10.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Défense d’Armure II","description":"Comme Défense d’Armure I, mais le bonus est de +10."},"en":{"name":"Armour Defense II","description":"As Armour Defense I, but the bonus is +10."}}},{"spellList":"Armourer","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Armour II","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ArmourII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.ArmourII.description","level":9,"description":"As Armour I, but grants +10 general or +15 against one broad group.","aoe":"self","duration":"24 hrs","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Armure II","description":"Comme Armure I, mais confère +10 en général ou +15 contre un vaste groupe de créatures."},"en":{"name":"Armour II","description":"As Armour I, but grants +10 general or +15 against one broad group."}}},{"spellList":"Armourer","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Enchant Cloth II","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.EnchantClothII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.armourer.spells.EnchantClothII.description","level":10,"description":"As Enchant Cloth I, with improved protection.","aoe":"caster","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"self","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Enchantement du Tissu II","description":"Comme Enchantement du Tissu I, avec une protec