 may operate constantly, subject to GM approval.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Constant","description":"Comme Quotidien X, mais les effets imprégnés appropriés peuvent fonctionner en permanence, sous réserve de l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Constant","description":"As Daily X, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval."}}},{"spellList":"Own Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Imbed True","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.ImbedTrue.description","level":50,"description":"Imbeds one Channeling spell of any level in an item; the imbedded spell is normally usable once.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imprégnation Véritable","description":"Imprègne dans un objet un sort de Théurgie de n’importe quel niveau ; le sort imprégné est normalement utilisable une seule fois."},"en":{"name":"Imbed True","description":"Imbeds one Channeling spell of any level in an item; the imbedded spell is normally usable once."}}},{"spellList":"Own Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Lord Daily","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.LordDaily.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.LordDaily.description","level":60,"description":"Creates exceptionally powerful daily-use Channeling items with spells through 20th level; this is artifact-scale magic and requires GM approval.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien Seigneur","description":"Crée des objets de Théurgie à usage quotidien exceptionnellement puissants, contenant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 20 ; il s’agit d’une magie de niveau artefact nécessitant l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Lord Daily","description":"Creates exceptionally powerful daily-use Channeling items with spells through 20th level; this is artifact-scale magic and requires GM approval."}}},{"spellList":"Own Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Lord Constant","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.LordConstant.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.LordConstant.description","level":75,"description":"As Lord Daily, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Constant Seigneur","description":"Comme Quotidien Seigneur, mais les effets imprégnés appropriés peuvent fonctionner en permanence, sous réserve de l’accord du MJ."},"en":{"name":"Lord Constant","description":"As Lord Daily, but appropriate imbedded effects may operate constantly, subject to GM approval."}}},{"spellList":"Own Realm Imbedding","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Daily True","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.DailyTrue.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.ownrealmimbedding.spells.DailyTrue.description","level":90,"description":"Creates daily-use Channeling items with spells through 50th level; this is artifact-scale magic requiring exceptional circumstances.","aoe":"1 item","duration":"24 hours","range":"self","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quotidien Véritable","description":"Crée des objets de Théurgie à usage quotidien contenant des sorts jusqu’au niveau 50 ; il s’agit d’une magie de niveau artefact exigeant des circonstances exceptionnelles."},"en":{"name":"Daily True","description":"Creates daily-use Channeling items with spells through 50th level; this is artifact-scale magic requiring exceptional circumstances."}}}]},"_id":"Yu1SttB6xfzhd1Ob"}
{"name":"Symbols","type":"spell-list","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-horned-white-purple.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"razak-zinul-symbols","collection":"merp-rmu","contentVersion":1,"sourceSystem":"RMSS/MERP","sourceBook":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5","sourceList":"Symbols","sourcePage":237,"merpRealm":"Channeling","merpCategory":"Profession","profession":"Razak-zinul","sorcery":false,"nativeRMU":false,"merpVariant":false,"source":{"type":"merp-rmss-spell-list-conversion","reference":"MERP/RMSS v2.5 pp. 237; Razak-zinul Base List"},"compendiumSourceKey":"razak-zinul-symbols","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-spell-lists","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/non-rmu-spell-lists.json","compendiumFolderKey":"spell-lists-channeling-razak-zinul","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Symboles","system":{"name":"Symboles","label":"Symboles","notesLabel":"Symboles — notes","notes":"<h2>Symboles</h2><p>Les Symbols sont des inscriptions permanentes capables de contenir un sort et de le déclencher lorsqu’une condition définie est remplie. La Liste permet aussi d’identifier, neutraliser temporairement et détruire les Symbols.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Symbols","system":{"name":"Symbols","label":"Symbols","notesLabel":"Symbols — notes","notes":"<h2>Symbols</h2><p>Symbols are permanent inscriptions capable of holding a spell and triggering it when a defined condition is fulfilled. The List also allows Symbols to be identified, temporarily neutralized, and destroyed.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Listes de Sorts de Théurgie","Razak-Zinul (Base)"],"en":["Channeling Spell Lists","Razak-Zinul (Base)"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["spell-lists-channeling","spell-lists-channeling-razak-zinul"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU / MERP-RMSS v2.5","name":"Symbols","listType":"Base","realms":"Channeling","profession":"Razak-zinul","notes":"<h2>Symbols</h2><p>Symbols are permanent inscriptions capable of holding a spell and triggering it when a defined condition is fulfilled. The List also allows Symbols to be identified, temporarily neutralized, and destroyed.</p>","label":"Symbols","notesLabel":"Symbols — notes","spells":[{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Detect Symbol","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.DetectSymbol.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.DetectSymbol.description","level":1,"description":"Detects an active symbol in the examined area; caster may examine a different area each round.","aoe":"5' R","duration":"1 min/lvl (C)","range":"50'","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Détection de Symbole","description":"Détecte un Symbole actif dans la zone examinée ; le lanceur peut examiner une zone différente à chaque round."},"en":{"name":"Detect Symbol","description":"Detects an active symbol in the examined area; caster may examine a different area each round."}}},{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Symbol Lore","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.SymbolLore.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.SymbolLore.description","level":2,"description":"Reveals which spell is emplaced in one symbol and how it is triggered.","aoe":"1 symbol","duration":"--","range":"50'","spellType":"I","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Connaissance des Symboles","description":"Révèle quel sort est placé dans un Symbole et de quelle manière il est déclenché."},"en":{"name":"Symbol Lore","description":"Reveals which spell is emplaced in one symbol and how it is triggered."}}},{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Bypass Symbol I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.BypassSymbolI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.BypassSymbolI.description","level":3,"description":"Temporarily turns off one Symbol I if the symbol fails its resistance.","aoe":"1 symbol","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"50'","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Contournement de Symbole I","description":"Désactive temporairement un Symbole I si celui-ci échoue à sa résistance."},"en":{"name":"Bypass Symbol I","description":"Temporarily turns off one Symbol I if the symbol fails its resistance."}}},{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Unsymbol I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.UnsymbolI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.UnsymbolI.description","level":4,"description":"Removes one Symbol I if the symbol fails its resistance.","aoe":"1 symbol","duration":"P","range":"10'","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Dissipation de Symbole I","description":"Supprime un Symbole I si celui-ci échoue à sa résistance."},"en":{"name":"Unsymbol I","description":"Removes one Symbol I if the symbol fails its resistance."}}},{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Symbol I","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.SymbolI.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.SymbolI.description","level":5,"description":"Creates a permanent symbol capable of holding an eligible low-level spell until triggered.","aoe":"varies","duration":"P","range":"10'","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Symbole I","description":"Crée un Symbole permanent capable de contenir un sort admissible de faible niveau jusqu’à son déclenchement."},"en":{"name":"Symbol I","description":"Creates a permanent symbol capable of holding an eligible low-level spell until triggered."}}},{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Symbol Extension","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.SymbolExtension.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.SymbolExtension.description","level":6,"description":"Extends the usable surface or placement options of one symbol.","aoe":"1 surface","duration":"P","range":"10'","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Extension de Symbole","description":"Étend la surface utilisable ou les possibilités de placement d’un Symbole."},"en":{"name":"Symbol Extension","description":"Extends the usable surface or placement options of one symbol."}}},{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Bypass Symbol III","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.BypassSymbolIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.BypassSymbolIII.description","level":7,"description":"As Bypass Symbol I, but works against symbols of greater capacity.","aoe":"1 symbol","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"50'","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Contournement de Symbole III","description":"Comme Contournement de Symbole I, mais fonctionne contre des Symboles de capacité supérieure."},"en":{"name":"Bypass Symbol III","description":"As Bypass Symbol I, but works against symbols of greater capacity."}}},{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Unsymbol III","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.UnsymbolIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.UnsymbolIII.description","level":8,"description":"As Unsymbol I, but can remove a stronger symbol.","aoe":"1 symbol","duration":"P","range":"10'","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Dissipation de Symbole III","description":"Comme Dissipation de Symbole I, mais peut supprimer un Symbole plus puissant."},"en":{"name":"Unsymbol III","description":"As Unsymbol I, but can remove a stronger symbol."}}},{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Symbol III","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.SymbolIII.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.SymbolIII.description","level":9,"description":"As Symbol I, but can hold a higher-level spell.","aoe":"varies","duration":"P","range":"10'","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Symbole III","description":"Comme Symbole I, mais peut contenir un sort de niveau supérieur."},"en":{"name":"Symbol III","description":"As Symbol I, but can hold a higher-level spell."}}},{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Bypass Symbol V","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.BypassSymbolV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.BypassSymbolV.description","level":10,"description":"As Bypass Symbol I, but works against stronger symbols.","aoe":"1 symbol","duration":"1 min/lvl","range":"50'","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Contournement de Symbole V","description":"Comme Contournement de Symbole I, mais fonctionne contre des Symboles plus puissants."},"en":{"name":"Bypass Symbol V","description":"As Bypass Symbol I, but works against stronger symbols."}}},{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Unsymbol V","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.UnsymbolV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.UnsymbolV.description","level":11,"description":"As Unsymbol I, but can remove a stronger symbol.","aoe":"1 symbol","duration":"P","range":"10'","spellType":"F","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Dissipation de Symbole V","description":"Comme Dissipation de Symbole I, mais peut supprimer un Symbole plus puissant."},"en":{"name":"Unsymbol V","description":"As Unsymbol I, but can remove a stronger symbol."}}},{"spellList":"Symbols","listType":"Base","profession":"Razak-zinul","name":"Symbol V","label":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.SymbolV.name","descriptionLabel":"MERP_RMU.RazakZinul.symbols.spells.SymbolV.description","level":12,"description":"As Symbol I, but can hold a higher-level spell.","aoe":"varies","duration":"P","range":"10'","spellType":"U","localizations":{"fr":{"name":"Symbole V","description":"Comme Symbole I, mais peut contenir un sort de niveau supérieur."},"en":{"name":